(2, 1, 'Oishi Potato Fries Cheese 21g', '4800194104777', 'Satisfy your taste buds with these Fries\' rich burst of cheese awesomeness. Made from fresh potatoes and are cooked until they are perfectly crispy. A ready-to-eat potato fries snack. Perfect for snacking at school, work or on-the-go. Grab this 1 pack (21 grams) of Oishi Potato Fries Cheese.', 96.24, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68222439.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Birch Tree Fortified Milk', '0748485401492', 'A trusted brand that nourished and built strong and healthy children for many generations. Its high-quality milk provides children with high levels of nutrients like calcium and zinc for them to perform well in their daily activities. It has immunity support nutrients and energy metabolism support nutrients to help keep the body’s immune system healthy and boost energy. Get this 1 pack (33 grams) of Birch Tree Fortified Milk.', 10.15, 5, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/98771427.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jack \'n Jill Mr. Chips Nacho Cheese 26g', '4800016652035', 'No-frills corn chips snack with just the right crunch and flavor that is exactly what you want in every chip. A triangular-shaped corn chips loaded with mucho Nacho cheese that spell a whole lot of fun and a whole lot of goodness. These much-loved treats are fun to enjoy at lunch, as an after-school snack, or party refreshment. Grab this 1 pack (26 grams) of Jack \'n Jill Mr. Chips Cheese.', 17.67, 29, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68220497.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Sunsilk Shampoo Smooth Manageable 15mlx288', '4800888169716', 'A smooth and fragrant hair with 5 flower perfumes that give the hair fragrance you love. It aims to make hair smoother, more manageable, and easier to style. Say goodbye to frizz and hello to gorgeous, manageable looks. Sold per tie in 12 pcs (13ml each) of Sunsilk Shampoo Smooth And Manageable.', 35.37, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68243008.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fibisco Chocolate Chip Cookies 400g', '4800040314138', 'Fibisco gives you all that you’ve been looking for in a chocolate chip cookie. So delectable real chocolate chips made from rich cocoa butter baked into a crunchy cookie base made with the finest of ingredients. With every bite comes an irresistible temptation to take another and another. Get this 1 container (400 grams) of Fibisco Chocolate Chips Cookies.', 4.05, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68199820.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'MY San Sky Flakes Saltine Crackers 850gm', '0750515018105', 'M.Y. San\'s high standards for quality and use of select ingredients, which put a premium on freshly-baked goodness, have earned numerous awards for its brands as well as the distinction of being a consistent favorite amongst various international markets.', 49.69, 5, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/154525237.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nature\'s Spring Purified Drinking Water 1000mL', '4800049720121', 'Nature\'s Spring Purified Drinking Water is a quality yet affordable brand for the daily consumption of clean and safe bottled water. It has been filtered or processed to remove impurities like chemicals and other contaminants. Helps dissolve minerals and nutrients, making them more accessible to the body. It contains no added substances and is not intended for use in parenteral products. Perfect size for an on-the-go lifestyle.', 98.71, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/230201427.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Creamline Creamy Ice Cream Double Dutch 1.3L', '4806514104427', 'No description found.', 19.15, 2, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89373705.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Markenburg Marshies Marshmallows Chocolate And Vanilla 40g', '4800519181063', 'Elevate your morning by topping off this choco & vanilla to your coffee or hot cocoa. They are delicious treats that are fun to share. Perfect treats to share, use as party favors, or give as a gift at your next birthday party celebration. Contains 40 grams of Marshies Marshmallows Chocolate and Vanilla.', 66.42, 8, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68229843.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Creamsilk Triple Keratin Rescue Ultimate Hairfall Defense 10ml X 12\'s', '4800888220950', 'The most advanced anti-hair fall 3-in-1 conditioning system that gives the benefits of 3 Keratin products in 1 ultimate solution. It reduces hair fall and strengthens weakened hair strands from the inside out for strong hair that’s ultimately break-resistant. Use this hair fall control conditioner daily for the best results. Sold per tie contains 12 pieces (10ml each) of Creamsilk Triple Keratin Rescue Ultimate Hairfall Defense.', 80.71, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68250428.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Creamsilk Daily Treatment Keratin Damage Repair 18ml X 12\'s', '4800888240064', 'No description found.', 26.71, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/144418040.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fresca Tuna Flakes In Oil 175g', '0748485900094', 'Savor the delectable taste of your favorite dish while enjoying the health benefits of fish. This product offers delicious goodness that you and your family will surely love. It is perfectly eaten with steamed rice, pasta, or bread. Contains 1 (175 grams) can of Fresca Tuna Flakes Oil.', 72.06, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68373886.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Wow Ulam Argentina Adobo 155g', '0748485802060', 'Wow is synonymous with innovative, great-tasting, filling, and affordable canned and freshly processed meat products. Made with freshly produced sausage in popular sauces that are inspired by well-loved Filipino dishes. Pre-cooked and ready to eat, making it a convenient option for busy days or when you\'re looking for a fuss-free meal. Get this 1 can containing 155 grams of Wow Ulam Adobo.', 19.79, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68379440.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Cerelac Nestlé Infant Cereals Rice & Soya 120g', '9556001132338', 'From 6 Months up to 2 Years. Half of Daily Iron Needs in 1 Serving. Zinc, Vitamins A, C & B1, Omega 3, Iodine. No Preservatives.', 18.47, 12, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/231872566.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jimms Black Coffee With Ginseng', '4806509690898', 'No description found.', 63.91, 23, 'https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/480/650/969/0898/front_en.4.400.jpg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Wilkins Pure Purified Water 1000mL', '4801981119981', 'Wilkins Pure is the purest water for everyday healthier living. It is known as the standard of purity and safety in bottled water. Perfect for the daily cleansing of body toxins and impurities. Most trusted drinking water by moms.', 38.93, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68443371.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Dutch Mill UHT Yoghurt Drink Strawberry 180ml X 4\'s Saver Pack', '8853002310347', 'Indulge in the delicious and nutritious Dutch Mill UHT Yoghurt Drink. Contains fresh milk, cultured yoghurt, and real fruit strawberry juice. Packed with calcium, protein, and vitamins that help nourish the body. Get these 4 pieces (180ml each) of Dutch Mill UHT Yogurt Drink Strawberry in one pack.', 55.47, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/35240174.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Close Up Toothpaste Menthol Fresh 3x20g', '4800888147240', 'Removes and prevents plaques and cavities that cause bad breath and damage to your teeth. Expertly made with a zinc anti-bacterial mouthwash to protect the mouth from bacteria. Get fresher breath and white teeth every day. Sold per 1 piece contains 20 grams of Close Up Gel Toothpaste Menthol Fresh.', 94.64, 17, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215247995.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Quaker Old Fashion Oatmeal 1.2kg', '9556174813683', '【商品名】クエーカー オートミール オールドファッション 1.2kg x3個【商品詳細】●クエーカー社のオートミール製品の中で、最もスタンダードな煮込んで作るオートミールです。●パンやクッキーなどに加え製菓材としてもご利用頂けます。●食物繊維、鉄分、マグネシウム、ビタミンB1を豊富に含むバランス朝食です。●たっぷり使える1.2kg、大容量タイプの 2個セットです。【召し上がり方】オートミール約40gに1カップ(約240)の水又はミルクと少量の食塩を加え、中火で約5分ときどきかき混ぜながら煮つめて出来上がりです。＊水・ミルク及び食塩はお好みにより加減して下さい。【内容量】1.', 89.95, 22, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/377276627.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nissin Bingo Sandwich Cookies Orange 10\'s', '4807770100536', 'Melt-in-the-mouth chocolate cookies with creamy orange filling. Sandwich cookies filled with a luscious orange-flavored creme. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This cookie is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 pcs of Nissin Bingo Sandwich Cookies Orange.', 48.29, 4, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/87351442.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Gatsby THC Moist Normal Treatment Hair Cream 100g', '4902806002683', 'No description found.', 98.89, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/83223924.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nissin Wafer Cheese King Size 22g X 10\'s', '4807770122385', 'Satisfy your sweet cravings with an all-time family favorite delicious snack that hits the spot. This cheese wafer snack is made with crispy wafers filled with yummy cheese creme. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This wafer is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 pieces (22 grams) of Nissin Wafer Cheese King Size.', 35.39, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68407718.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
