(2, 1, 'Rebisco Extreme Sandwich Ultimate Choco 10\'s', '4800092113109', 'Experience extreme chocolate goodness. Extreme snacking experience with choco crackers, choco filling, choco coating, and choco sprinkles. Beyond-the-ordinary biscuit snacking for multi-tasking. Comes in 10 pieces per pack. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This biscuit is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per pack contains 10 pcs of Rebisco Extreme Sandwich Choco-Coated.', 28.47, 26, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68256256.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
