(2, 1, 'Listerine Total Care Mouthwash 250mL', '8850007812173', 'With anti-cavity fluoride that fights and protects against cavities. It kills germs that cause bad breath, plaque, and gingivitis. Try it today and transform your oral hygiene!. Sold per bottle contains 250ml of Listerine Mouthwash Total Care.', 10.85, 2, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68467588.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rebisco Combi Sandwich Triple Choco 10\'s', '4800092112782', 'A great combination for any snack time. Crunchy choco crackers + choco wafer + delicious choco cream filling sandwiched together. Perfect crackers for snacking or quick meals. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 pieces of Rebisco Combi Sandwich Triple Choco.', 83.39, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225932.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
