(2, 1, 'Rebisco Cracker Sandwich Flavor Bunch 10\'s', '4800092112898', 'These crackers sandwich a mouthwatering cream spread between two Rebisco crackers. Rebisco Sandwich Crackers sandwiching delicious cream fillings that come in 6 flavors - Choco, Strawberry, Cream, Butter, and Peanut Butter. For a great anytime snack and a perfect compliment for lunchboxes or quick meals. These delicious treats are with you for a convenient snack while you\'re on the go, and are perfect for lunches. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 pieces of Rebisco Cracker Sandwich Flavor Bunch.', 15.79, 34, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225940.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Coca-Cola Coke Mismo 290ml', '4801981118502', 'Energize your senses with Coke. Best enjoyed cold for maximum refreshment. Perfect drink in the afternoon, on the go, with your meal, or any time. Good for parties, meals, and celebrations big and small. Get this 1 bottle (290ml) of Coke Mismo.', 92.18, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68261177.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Superstix Wafer Sticks Chocolate 330g', '4800092110535', 'Your favorite Superstix, now with superdots, gives you more flavors in every bite. Superstix snacking becomes a super experience with the addition of the super dots. For great anytime snack and a perfect compliment for lunchboxes or quick meals. These delicious treats are perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Get this 1 container (330 grams) of Rebisco Superstix Wafer Sticks Choco Refill.', 100.30, 17, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352623899.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rebisco Wafer Time Vanilla Creamy Milk 11g X 20\'s', '4800092114755', 'Flat wafer sandwiches with deliciously rich creamy vanilla filling abundantly present in every bite. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This wafer is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per pack contains 20 (11 grams each) pcs of Rebisco Wafer Time Vanilla Creamy Milk.', 67.07, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68428940.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tanduay Rhum Light Smooth Spirit 750mL', '4800220587154', 'Tanduay’s Master blender developed this rich blend of rum with just the right sweetness and aroma. This 55-proof special blend boasts of compelling smooth flavor without much woody notes, full-bodied yet with an edge of sweetness on the tail. Perfect for fun, light drinking moments with friends. Get this 1 bottle (750ml) of Tanduay Rhum Light.', 62.64, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68209540.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rebisco Wafer Time Choco 13g 20s', '4800092114373', 'Flat wafer sandwiches with deliciously rich chocolate filling abundantly present in every bite. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This wafer is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per pack contains 20 (13 grams each) pcs of Rebisco Wafer Time Crispy Choco Filled.', 77.59, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68428945.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
