(2, 1, 'Lucky Me Special Instant Noodles Jjampong 55g', '4807770273100', 'A spicy seafood noodle soup that is a popular dish in Chinese-Korean cuisine. It is easy to prepare so it is perfect for many people who are so busy and have no time to think and prepare recipes every day. It has an uber-spicy Korean spice that gives a kick to the seafood flavor. The soup has some real seafood flavor and pairs with the noodles full of chewy texture. Enjoy it with cuttlefish and wakame seaweed toppings. Get this 1 pack (55 grams) of Lucky Me Special Instant Noodles Jjampong.', 84.60, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/35233286.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
