(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Vinegar - Sukang Puti 13.02oz', '4800344004421', 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti promises to make dishes even more delectable with its mild acidity. A delicious ingredient to add to marinades for your favorite meat dishes. Used to attain the right amount of sourness in the meals you prepare. Perfect for use in food preparation, and as an ingredient in popular sauces.', 28.43, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/219771165.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
