(2, 1, 'Skin White Whitening Soap Classic 65g', '4800119214093', 'Skin White Bath Soap is enriched with our Vitanourish formula with Vitamins B3, B5, B6, C, and E. This soap safely and effectively attacks the 3 stages of melanin production, helping to achieve your whitest skin with regular use. Use this product together with a Skinwhite power whitening lotion. Get this 1 bar containing 65 grams of Skin White Bath Soap Classic.', 28.96, 17, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68434360.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
