(2, 1, 'Downy Fabric Conditioner Garden Bloom 26ml 6\'s + 1', '4902430846455', 'Worry less about the unpleasant odor with Downy Fabric Conditioner Garden Bloom. Downy fights against tough bad smells with anti-odor ingredients. Give long-lasting freshness and make your clothes soft. Suitable for top-loading and front-loading washing machines. Helps to protect fabrics from stretching, discoloration, and fluffing. This will freshen all of your laundries at home with just one cap.', 30.97, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/111719497.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16');
