(2, 1, 'Nongshim Shin Ramen Noodles Korean', '8801043014809', 'Giới thiệu sản phẩm Mì Shin New NongShim 120g 8801043014809 Mì Shin New NongShim 120g 8801043014809chỉ cần vài bước chế biến là bạn đã có món mì thơm ngon mà không mất nhiều thời gian cho bản thân và cả gia đình trong những lúc bận rộn. Sản phẩm được làm từ nguyên liệu cao cấp: Vắt mì, bột mỳ, tinh bột khoai tây, chất điều vị, dầu thực vật, muối, đường, bột thịt bò, bột đậu tương, bột nấm, nấm sấy khô, cà rốt sấy, tinh chất gừng. Sợi mì dai thơm và vàng tự nhiên, hòa quyện cùng nước súp thơm ngon đặc trưng của Hàn Quốc. Sản phẩm không không chứa chất bảo quản, an toàn khi dùng, cung cấp năng lượng cho cơ thể. Thông tin thương hiệu NongShimlà thương hiệu có xuất xứ từ Hàn Quốc, chuyên sản xuất kinh doanh các loại thực phẩm đóng gói có hương vị Hàn Quốc đặc trưng thơm ngon hấp dẫn. Các sản phẩm của được chọn lựa từ những nguyên liệu cao cấp, trên quy trình chế biến hiện đại, không chỉ được người dân trong nước tin dùng mà còn xuất khẩu sang các nước ngoài, được nhiều người tìm mua và săn đón.', 2.15, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/107222880.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Soy Sauce 200ml 11 + 1', '4800344010019', 'Silver Swan Soy Sauce promises to delight your palates with just the right amount of sweetness and saltiness. Made by fermenting soybeans or breaking them down with acid (hydrolyzing). Provides a natural salty, umami flavor to food. It is a dark liquid condiment that is a perfect partner for your culinary needs. Sold per pack contains 11 pieces (200ml each) of Silver Swan Soy Sauce with 1 piece free.', 2.29, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68202343.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'RAM Baking Soda 8.8oz (250g)', '4800017974808', 'No description found.', 15.23, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38252209.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Axion Dishwashing Paste Lemon Bonus Pack 550g', '9556031096433', 'It has a powerful grease-stripping formula that eliminates dirt and tough grease with the fresh scent of Lemon. Cleans and disinfects dishes, pots, pans, kitchen lavatories, and other surfaces. Kills common household surface bacteria in the sponge and dishes for up to 24 hours. Each cup contains a free sponge inside.', 59.76, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68271414.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'แองเจิ้ล สโตนี่ ชุดที่ปั๊มนม รุ่น 16002', '8850851700251', 'No description found.', 89.39, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/77084890.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nature\'s Spring Distilled Water 6.6L', '4800049715608', 'Nature\'s Spring Distilled Drinking Water is the mothers\' go-to water brand. Recommended by Pediatricians due to its quality, purity, safety, and affordability. Helps dissolve minerals and nutrients, making them more accessible to the body. It undergoes a 12-stage process with different levels of filtration, purification, and distillation processes to remove impurities using state-of-the-art facilities.', 51.62, 2, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68268429.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lactacyd Milky Rich Moisture Bath Hair & Body 500ml Pump Baby Bath 500ml', '4800136020028', 'No description found.', 67.15, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/53359634.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Zonrox Bleach Original 1/2 Gal', '4800047840050', 'Have hassle-free removing stains and odors from your clothes using Zonrox Bleach Original. Keep your home and laundry clean and free from sickness-causing germs. Combines the whitening and antibacterial protection of bleach. It is a multi-purpose bleach for home and laundry. Kills disease-causing germs and viruses.', 2.31, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/66586952.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Soy Sauce Jumbo Pack 1L', '4800344001642', 'Silver Swan Soy Sauce promises to delight your palates with just the right amount of sweetness and saltiness. Made by fermenting soybeans or breaking them down with acid (hydrolyzing). Provides a naturally salty, umami flavor to food. It is a dark liquid condiment that is a perfect partner for your culinary needs.', 30.61, 4, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68202327.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Datu Puti White Vinegar SUP 1L', '4801668603635', 'Datu Puti Vinegar is the undisputed leading vinegar brand that provides a strong nuot-asim taste. A delicious ingredient to add to marinades for your favorite meat dishes. Used to attain the right amount of sourness in the meals you prepare. Perfect for use in food preparation, and as an ingredient in popular sauces.', 51.69, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68259624.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Baguio Orchids Brand Vegetable Oil Refill 1.8L', '4804880241166', 'Stock your pantry with Baguio Vegetable Oil for all of your cooking needs. Packed with nutrients and more health benefits than ordinary oils. Strengthens the immune system and protects skin cells from toxins and UV radiation. Great for sautéing, stir-frying, roasting, grilling, and deep-frying. It is often used for baked goods and packaged food. Sold per pack contains 1.8 liters of Baguio Orchids Brand Pure Vegetable Oil.', 97.57, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68196400.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Great Value Creamy Peanut Butter 545g – Mantequilla De Mani', '0194346116607', 'No description found.', 79.74, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/118412677.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Coca-Cola Sprite Lemon-Lime Drink 1.5L', '4801981116270', 'Refresh and energize your senses with Sprite. It is a caffeine-free carbonated soft drink with no added color. Best enjoyed cold for maximum refreshment. Ideal for parties, meals, and celebrations big and small. Perfect size for snacking and on the go. Get this 1 bottle (1.5 liters) of Sprite.', 27.97, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68210132.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Pampers Baby Dry Diapers Small 18\'s', '4902430615266', 'Thinner and more flexible for comfort. Now with faster absorbency and less sagging than before. Supreme, silky softness silk-like supreme comfort for active babies. Always 360 airy fresh keep baby comfortably fresh. Comfort s-flex pampers unique s-flex gently moves with baby for just the right fit and less pressure on their skin. Get this 1 pack containing 18 pieces of Pampers Diaper Baby Dry Small.', 4.80, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68164485.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Eskinol Naturals Facial Cleanser Papaya Smooth White 135ml', '4806789442163', 'Removes deep-seated dirt, excess oil, and make-up with Micro-Cleanse & Anti-bacterial formula. It has pure papaya extracts to help refresh your skin. With Water Minerals to help replenish moisture. Whitens your skin with continued use. Controls oil for hours and removes excess oil, based on clinical tests. Get this 1 bottle containing 135ml of Eskinol Naturals Facial Cleanser Papaya Smooth White.', 30.36, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68239494.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Pik-Nik 50% Less Salt Shoestring Potatoes 113g', '0074923405211', 'Pik-Nik Original Shoestring Potatoes Less Salt is a perfect treat for snacking. Once you started eating this, you won\'t stop. It\'s more fun to share it with friends and family. Especially if you are watching the salt intake.', 24.61, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/44892981.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Babyflo Petroleum Jelly Powdery Fresh 50g', '4800067070758', 'No description found.', 85.36, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/53364925.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Dr. Isla Baby Oral Cleaner 30 Pcs', '6973819571570', 'A Baby Oral Cleaner is a Small, Disposable, and Soft Tool Designed to Gently Clean a Baby’s Gums, Tongue, and the Inside of Their Cheeks Before Their First Teeth Emerge. They Are Typically Made of Medical-grade Gauze or Soft Silicone and Are Often Pre-moistened With Purified Water or a Saline Solution for Convenience and to Avoid Introducing Chemicals to the Baby’s Mouth. Regular Use Helps Establish Good Oral Hygiene Habits Early on and Removes Milk Residue and Bacteria, Which Can Prevent Future Dental Problems.', 91.33, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/391289270.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Povidone-Iodine Betadine Wound Solution 120mL', '4800204002024', 'No description found.', 58.02, 45, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38256823.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Holiday Spaghetti Sauce Meat Sauce 380g', '4800066623801', 'A luscious, thick, red sauce containing ground beef and a special mix of seasonings. Guaranteed to give your spaghetti recipe that distinct sweet Filipino taste. Perfectly complementing the savory taste of the meatballs. A family-friendly option that\'s sure to please everyone\'s palate. Get this 1 can containing 380 grams of Holiday Spaghetti Sauce Meat Sauce.', 71.37, 44, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68257395.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16');
