(2, 1, 'Ferrero Rocher T8 Heart Chocolate 100g', '8000500005026', 'Premium chocolates, ideal for gifting. Multi-layered chocolate individually wrapped. Unique taste experience of contrasting layers. Whole crunchy hazelnut in the heart, a delicious creamy hazelnut filling. Crisp wafer shell covered with chocolate. Gently roasted piece. Sold per pack contains 100 grams of Ferrero Rocher Chocolate T.8.', 24.85, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/306352434.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Magnolia Original All Purpose Cream 250ml', '4805358651050', 'This All-Purpose Cream is a good base for your savory dishes. Made with the finest quality ingredients with health benefits. Very versatile enough to be paired with vegetables and different kinds of meat. Great for desserts, cream-based savory dishes, pasta sauces, dips, and dressings. Get this 1 pack containing 250ml of Magnolia All Purpose Cream.', 20.92, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68208936.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Filipino Style Tomato Sauce 200g', '4800024575425', 'Del Monte Filipino Style Tomato Sauce is made with 100% real tomatoes specially blended for a milder and sweeter tomato note. It has the blend of sweet-sour taste, thickness and color right thickness, color and appetizing aroma best for any type of dish.', 64.72, 23, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/145977761.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'UFC Tomato Sauce Guisado 115g', '0014285003984', 'Ufc Tomato Sauce has the perfect fusion of sour and sweet notes that adds a rich taste to your classic Filipino tomato-based favorites. Made with natural tomatoes.', 32.42, 12, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/234495819.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jersey Evaporada Evaporated Creamer 370mL', '9555513203017', 'مثالية لإضافتها إلى وصفاتك الحلوة والمالحة للحصول على نكهة كريمية إضافية. ويمكن أيضًا أن يكون بديلاً جيدًا للحليب والقشدة، أو إضافته إلى القهوة والمشروبات المخلوطة الأخرى، أو يمكن استخدامه بدلاً من الماء عند خبز الخبز ويشكل قاعدة لذيذة للصلصات البيضاء. 370 مل/علبة.', 24.46, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68189703.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Fiesta Fruit Cocktail In Extra Light Syrup', '4800024550958', 'Discover a burst of fruity flavors with this fruit cocktail. Consists of mixed fruits like papaya, pineapple, and cherries and some pieces of nata de coco. Perfect for making a healthy snack or adding a tropical touch to your favorite desserts. Sold per 1 can containing 3033 grams of Del Monte Fiesta Fruit Cocktail.', 64.06, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68303284.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Todays Mixed Fruit', '4800024558268', 'A tasty, preservative-free mix of pineapples, papaya, nata de coco, and cherries in naturally-flavored extra light syrup. A convenient and economical way of giving your family a healthy serving of fruit. Enjoy each fruit\'s juicy taste and texture, and feel good about nourishing your body with today\'s best natural fruits. Sold per 1 canister contains 836 grams of Del Monte Today\'s Mixed Fruit.', 87.89, 5, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68374711.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nutri Snack Moby Caramel Puffs', '4800523223827', 'No description found.', 84.39, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/356742654.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jack N Jill N Chippy Corn Chips Barbecue 108g', '4800016643095', 'Chippy is almost like a brand name in itself. This famous Jack n Jill Chippy Barbecue Flavored Corn Chips needs no introduction to Filipinos everywhere. Bonus points for barbeque lovers all over the world!', 3.46, 21, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352196540.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jack \'n Jill Chippy Corn Chips Chili Cheese 108g', '4800016641503', 'Crunchy corn chips in their signature delicious chili cheese flavor. Every barkada\'s goto snack with its signature crunchy corn chips in tasty chili cheese flavor. These much-loved treats are fun to enjoy at lunch, as an after-school snack, or party refreshment. Grab this 1 pack (108 grams) of Jack \'n Jill Chippy Corn Chips Chili Cheese.', 97.29, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/374822371.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Prawn Crackers Sweet & Extra Hot Flavor - 90g', '4800194177955', 'Delicious Oishi Prawn crackers - Sweet & extra spicy. Not for the faint hearted.', 8.34, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/218405889.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Cracklings, Classic, Ribbed, In Salt & Vinegar', '0897399001028', 'Oishi ribbed crackling chips are a delicious crunchy, snack made with old fashioned favorite salt and vinegar. These cracklings are made as thick, bite-sized pieces to give a satisfying, snack-time crunch. These crackling chips are packed with flavor and will be a perfect pairing for any refreshing beverage. From its humble beginnings of âgawgawâ and coffee 70 years ago, Liwayway Marketing Corporation has taken on bigger and more exciting adventures. In 1974, Oishi was brought to life and has become the much celebrated snack brand, with iconic products like Oishi Prawn Crackers and Kirei. The adventure continued with a dash of creativity and innovation from products like Martyâs Cracklinâ Vegetarian Chicharon, to surprise bursts of chocolate from Pillows. Today, Oishiâs World of O, Wow!', 73.93, 44, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/98916055.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Fish Cracker 90g', '4800194177146', 'A blend of rich, salty flavor meets the classic spicy taste flavor. This fish crackers snack delivers big and bold flavors that fire up your tastebuds with every bite. Perfect snack option for when you’re up late studying, headed to school, embarking on an exciting wild road trip, or hanging with friends at a party.', 20.66, 18, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225618.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Spicy Seafood Curls Shrimp Flavored Snack - 90g', '4800194178167', 'No description found.', 18.05, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/118502884.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Marty’s Crackling Chicharron Chicken Inasal 90g', '4800194179836', 'This snack captures the authentic, smoky flavor of traditional chicken inasal, delivering a bold and savory taste in every bite. Vegetarian chicharon old-fashioned Style and 0g Trans Fat. Perfect for packing lunches and snacking on the go. Enjoy these delicious, crunchy chicken inasal cracklings without guilt.', 47.98, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68215648.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Potato Fries Cheese 90g', '4800194177771', 'Satisfy your taste buds with these Fries\' rich burst of cheese awesomeness. Made from fresh potatoes and are cooked until they are perfectly crispy. A ready-to-eat potato fries snack. Perfect for snacking at school, work or on-the-go. Grab this 1 pack (90 grams) of Oishi Potato Fries Cheese.', 40.23, 5, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/241862704.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Fishda Fish Kropeck 80g', '4800194180184', 'Made with fish and fried for superior crispness and flavor. Delicious crunchy fish kropeck. These shareable snacks are perfect for hanging out with friends or enjoying on your own. Get this 1 pack (80 grams) of Oishi Fishda Fish Kropeck.', 23.51, 45, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/87442497.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Marty\'s Cracklin\' Spicy Vinegar Flavor 90g', '4800194179898', 'Oishi Marty’s Crackling Spicy Vinegar Flavour offers a zesty twist to the traditional Filipino vegetarian chicharon. Made with green pea starch, tapioca starch, and dehydrated potato starch, these crunchy snacks are seasoned with a blend of spices, vinegar powder, and garlic powder for a tangy kick. With no artificial colours or preservatives, they’re a flavourful and satisfying snack option. Store in a cool, dry place to maintain freshness.', 75.59, 4, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/129364635.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Crispy Patata Baked Potato Flavor 85g', '4800194177863', 'An irresistible snack with a big, bold taste and a whole bag of delicious rye chips. A kind of krupuk-like chip with a potato flavor. Crisp and delightful texture. Perfect for snacking at school, work, or on the go.', 15.73, 26, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68222413.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bonakid 1-3 Years Old Milk Supplement Powder 350g', '4800153151255', 'Breastmilk is the best for babies up to 2 years of age and beyond. Ang gatas ng ina ang pinakamabuti para sa bata hanggang 2 taon at higit pa.', 9.43, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68450511.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Oishi Pillows Choco-Filled Crackers 150g', '4800194114462', 'Oishi Pillows Chocolate (Tsokolate) is a Choco-filled square pillow crackers that is a versatile snack for all occasions. This treat is great for sharing with family and friends!', 28.66, 34, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352632739.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Monde Eggnog Cookies 130gm', '4807770100406', 'Made with real fresh eggs, these light and flavorful droplets of rich-tasting cookies make the perfect snack for kids. These cookies are a kind of egg cake but baked crispy and almost the size of gingerbread. Nice and crunchy and delicious as a snack. This cookie is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Get this 1 pack (130 grams) of Nissin Eggnog Cookies.', 50.70, 25, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68344635.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Gillette Blue 2 Flexi – Disposable Razors 1pk', '4987176101389', 'No description found.', 96.26, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/237031059.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Candyman White Rabbit Butter Toffee - 100Pcs', '4800317100013', 'Melt smoothly in your mouth buttery sweet caramel candy. Made with creamy caramel, for a smooth taste that is one of a kind. Individually wrapped caramels are perfect for sharing. Sold per 1 pack contains 100 pcs of White Rabbit Candy.', 63.63, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68232891.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Birch Tree Fortified Powdered Milk Drink 925g', '0748485401706', 'A powdered milk drink that provides essential vitamins and minerals, including Vitamin A, Vitamin D3, calcium, and iron. Use it to make a refreshing glass of milk, add it to smoothies, or incorporate it into baked goods. Make this milk a part of your daily routine and enjoy the nourishment and satisfaction it brings. Sold per 1 pack contains 925 grams of Birch Tree Fortified Powdered Milk Drink.', 33.62, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68374706.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Soy Sauce 10ml', '4800344001420', 'Silver Swan Soy Sauce promises to delight your palates with just the right amount of sweetness and saltiness. Made by fermenting soybeans or breaking them down with acid (hydrolyzing). Provides a natural salty, umami flavor to food. It is a dark liquid condiment that is a perfect partner for your culinary needs.', 57.05, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/148607457.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-04-03 01:36:48'),
