(2, 1, 'CEELIN Gummies Vitamin C Orange 30 Gummies', '4807788766229', 'Now in the yummy gummy format, this vitamins for kids is individually packed and can be taken anywhere to help kids’ immunity. From the makers of Unilab, this vitamins for children is:. Gluten-free. 100% Vegan. Ceelin Gummies is a good alternative to Scott’s Chewables. Do not forget to include this health supplmement essential in the next groceries list.', 53.88, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215636802.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
