(2, 1, '555 Tuna Flakes - Caldereta 5.5oz', '0748485700038', 'A 555 Filipino favourite packed with tasty energy thanks to its tuna chunks, peas, carrots and spices. 55 Tuna\'s fiesta of flavors, inspired by a rich bounty of all-time Pinoy favorite dishes makes the perfect ulam for everyone.!', 53.03, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352606389.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Juice N Power Watermelon Mojito Shortfill E-Liquid By 100ml', '5060973721284', 'Watermelon Mojito shortfill e-liquid by Juice N Power captures the taste of a classic cocktail with a tropical twist. Zesty lime and cool mint combine to recreate a mojito flavour whilst watermelon adds distinct sweet notes. This e-liquid features a 70% VG concentration, so it’ll create large amounts of vapour for a DTL (Direct To Lung) vape. It works best when paired with a sub ohm device . Watermelon Mojito contains 100ml of nicotine-free e-liquid in a 120ml bottle. You’ll need to add nic shots to make a nicotine-containing vape. For a 3mg blend, try adding two 18mg nic shots. Juice N Power e-liquids are blended and bottled right here in the UK. They offer freebase, nic salt and shortfill blends in a range of fruit, dessert and mint flavours, so whether you’re an MTL (Mouth To Lung) or sub ohm vaper, there’s an option for you. 100ml Of E-Liquid In A 120ml Bottle Space Inside For Two Nic Shots 70% VG / 30% PG For Sub Ohm Vaping Made In The UK TPD Compliant Recyclable Bottle Childproof Cap Tamper Evident Seal.', 92.09, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/394670763.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Vitress Hair Polish Long Lasting Fragrance 50ml', '4800119215182', 'Infused with Scent-infinity Complex that keeps hair smelling fresh all day. Keeps hair looking sleek and shiny. Helps tame frizz and smooth down flyaway. Helps hair stay healthy, shiny, and silky smooth anytime, anywhere. Sold in 1 tube (50ml) of Vitress Hair Polish Long Lasting Fragrance.', 63.49, 36, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68192983.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Columbia\'s Pintoora Gumball 25\'s', '4800818808777', 'Add a splash of color to your day with Columbia’s Gumball. Each gumball is chewy and bursting with a colorful treat. Perfect for sharing, parties, or simply chewing the boredom away. Get these 25 pieces of Columbia\'s Pintoora Gumball in one pack.', 68.54, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68230467.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Sanicare Plastic Stem Cotton Buds 200 Tips', '4806502350171', 'The cotton buds have a wide range of uses including makeup, baby, first aid, and more. Our cotton swabs for ears come in a nice small container. The cotton stick is clean and has a smooth texture. Get this 1 can (200 pcs) of Sanicare Cotton Buds.', 21.86, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68255164.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
