(2, 1, 'Im Mart Korean Grocery San Miguel Flavored Beer Apple Flavor 330mL', '4801032281049', 'The first and best fruit-flavored beer San Miguel has ever brewed. Quirky and imaginatively unique, it comes in two exciting fruit flavors – apple and lemon. A fruity twist to the refreshing qualities of beer.', 87.52, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/349076309.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
