(2, 1, 'Minola Premium Coconut Oil Sulit Pouch 200ml', '4800094098831', 'Solidification of coconut oil at a cold temperature is its natural characteristic and does not affect the quality (hindi sebo). Research shows that coconut oil:. Is Transfat Free - a natural product that does not contain hydrogenated fat.', 19.71, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68365044.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Minola Premium Coconut Oil (Pouch) 1L', '4800094096240', 'Ensure your dishes are cooked to perfection every time with Minola Cooking Oil. Packed with nutrients and more health benefits than ordinary oils. . Good for your heart, strengthens immunity, and is not high in cholesterol. . Best for everyday use, frying/deep frying, sauteeing, baking, and a lot more.', 68.32, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68364099.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Alaska Condensada Sweetened Condensed Creamer Value Pack 560g', '4800575143371', 'Alaska Condensada helps Filipino families turn traditional Pinoy desserts into tasty family favorites. Condensed milk is a good source of these nutrients in addition to calcium, vitamin D, vitamin B12, vitamin A, riboflavin, phosphorus, and protein. These nutrients are necessary for healthy teeth and bones, a robust immune system, and a cardiovascular system. Perfect for your Leche flan, ube halaya, halo-halo, and other desserts.', 11.63, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68188739.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Arm & Hammer Baking Soda Shaker 340g', '0033200976592', 'Keep your home clean and fresh with Arm And Hammer Baking Soda. Pure, safe, and natural baking soda with hundreds of uses like deodorizing, cleaning, and baking. Convenient dual-sided shaker lid for easy sprinkling, pouring, and scooping. The removable lid and the reusable bottle make refilling with baking soda easy. 100% recyclable bottle packaging. Resealable, a moisture-resistant design ideal for storage in the kitchen and bathroom. Get this 1 canister (340 grams) of Arm And Hammer Baking Soda Shaker.', 97.08, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/120940068.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Queen Pure Baking Soda 125g', '4800300300017', 'Queen Pure Baking Soda is used for baking, cleaning, deodorizing, and more. It is a leavening agent used in baked goods like cakes, muffins, and cookies. Natural and effective for taking care of every room in the house. Free of harsh chemicals and gentle enough to use on many surfaces.', 30.94, 50, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68186466.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mega Prime Fruit Cocktail EOC 850g', '4806504713189', 'Made with quality sweetened fruits and now even better. It comes in easy-open cans making food preparations easier and faster. Has natural juice of the fruit adds essential nutrients. Get this Mega Prime Fruit Cocktail that contains 850 grams in each can.', 5.16, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/83220476.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Cream All Purpose Flour 400g', '0731126012140', 'Experience the versatility and quality of Cream All Purpose Flour. Made from the finest, all-natural ingredients. Suitable for all types of baked goods and dishes. It is also used to thicken gravies and sauces. Get this 1 carton (400 grams) of Cream All Purpose Flour.', 10.62, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68186476.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
