(2, 1, 'Michigan Made Blueberry Pie Filling', '0071109666411', 'Enhance your baked goods with Michigan Made. Filled with tangy sweet blueberries, rich in antioxidants, and still popping when you bite into them. Bursting with the goodness of juicy blueberry. Use this for your blueberry pie or as a topping on ice cream or other desserts. Get this 1 can (595 grams) of Michigan Made Pie Filling And Dessert Topping Blueberry.', 82.91, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68235759.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mr Hat Gulaman Unflavored Jelly Powder White 25g', '4809013526356', 'Elevate your dessert creations with this white gulaman powder. Provides a smooth, firm texture that enhances the appeal of your desserts. Perfect ingredient for creating delightful and satisfying Filipino desserts and beverages. Best jelly dessert mix for lunches, desserts, parties, snacks, picnics, and more. Sold per 1 pack contains 25 grams of Mr. Hat Gulaman Jelly Powder Mix White.', 8.58, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68206729.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mr Hat Gulaman Red Unflavored Jelly Powder 25g', '4809013526318', 'Elevate your dessert creations with this red gulaman powder. Provides a smooth, firm texture that enhances the appeal of your desserts. Perfect ingredient for creating delightful and satisfying Filipino desserts and beverages. Best jelly dessert mix for lunches, desserts, parties, snacks, picnics, and more. Sold per 1 pack contains 25 grams of Mr. Hat Gulaman Jelly Powder Mix Red.', 7.79, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68206742.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
