(2, 1, 'Duncan Hines Comstock Pie Filling & Topping, Original Royal Blueberry', '0041255015296', '. With Wilderness Pie Filling & Topping, you get truly homemade taste and quality. . A delightful addition to your baking and dessert creations. . Bursting with the goodness of juicy blueberry. . This filling and topping offer a convenient way to elevate your pies, cakes, pastries, and more. . Get this 1 can containing 21oz of Duncan Hines Comstock Pie Filling And Topping Royal Blueberry.', 94.27, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68235764.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mr Hat Gulaman Lychee Flavored Jelly Powder 25g', '4809013526288', 'Elevate your dessert creations with this flavored Lychie gulaman powder. Provides a smooth, firm texture that enhances the appeal of your desserts. Perfect ingredient for creating delightful and satisfying Filipino desserts and beverages. Best jelly dessert mix for lunches, desserts, parties, snacks, picnics, and more. Sold per 1 pack contains 25 grams of Mr. Hat Gulaman Flavored Jelly Powder Lychie.', 26.32, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68206743.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'White King Ultimate Fudge Brownie Mix 580g', '4800110068800', 'Here is an easy way to prepare your all-time favorite brownies with White King Ultimate Fudge Brownie Mix. Perfect for any occasion, from family gatherings to holiday celebrations. With simple instructions, you\'ll be enjoying homemade brownies in no time. Get this 1 box (580 grams) of White King Ultimate Fudge Brownie Mix.', 42.70, 29, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243426872.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Sunbest Coffee Jelly 540g', '4806516630627', 'Tastes sweet with a coffee flavor thanks to the coffee bean used to make the jelly. Perfect for making slushies, smoothies, juices, flavored teas, frozen yogurt, shaved ice, and even alcoholic drinks. Enjoy coffee jelly chilled and served with fresh fruit for a delicious dessert. Get this 1 can containing 540 grams of Sunbest Cofee Jelly.', 65.45, 25, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/205540376.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Wings Total Care Bar Lavender Dream 390g', '8998866612319', 'Wings powder offers brilliant clean and multi-sensorial satisfaction at affordable prices. Made from biodegradable cleaning materials that are proven to be environment-friendly. Removes dirt and provides a refreshing scent on clothes that lasts longer. Provides spotless clean clothes with a burst of freshness. Suitable for washing both colors and whites. Ideal for indoor drying with no kulob smell.', 50.22, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/66587036.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Perla Original White – Laundry Soap Bar – 110 G', '4902430178259', 'Hypoallergenic formula. Original white variant for maintaining vibrant colors. Convenient 110g size with an extra 15% more product. Effectively removes tough stains and dirt. Gentle on fabrics, preserving their quality over time. Provides a thorough clean without causing irritation. Trusted and reliable laundry soap brand.', 56.08, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/66586581.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Alaska All-Purpose Creamer 250ml', '4800575145054', 'Prepare sweet and savory dishes with Alaska Creamer. Helps enhance the taste of your creations by adding luscious creaminess and richness. Ideal for soups, salads, pasta dishes, dips, and dressings. Get this 1 piece (250ml) of Alaska All Purpose Creamer.', 4.49, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/242711167.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nestle All Purpose Cream', '4800361423564', 'Prepare sweet and savory dishes with Nestle Creamer. Helps enhance the taste of your creations by adding luscious creaminess and richness. Ideal for soups, salads, pasta dishes, dips, and dressings. Delight your family with a heavenly bite that brings gourmet goodness to your home. Get these 2 pieces (250ml each) of Nestle All-Purpose Cream Original and save as much as 15 pesos.', 71.58, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/392636230.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Tomato Sauce Original Style 1KG', '4800024556165', 'Prepare to experience the explosion of the milder and sweeter taste of Del Monte Tomato Sauce in your mouth. Made with high-quality real tomatoes, specially blended for a milder and sweeter tomato note. Used in a wide variety of dishes, from pasta and pizzas to stews and soups. Enjoy it in your favorite pasta sauce and tomato dishes today. Sold per 1 pack containing 900 grams of Del Monte Tomato Sauce.', 10.67, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/160714721.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Datu Puti Soy Sauce Refill Pack 200mL', '4801668602034', 'Datu Puti Soy Sauce promises to delight your palates with just the right amount of sweetness and saltiness. Made by fermenting soybeans or breaking them down with acid (hydrolyzing). Provides a naturally salty, umami flavor to food. It is a dark liquid condiment that is a perfect partner for your culinary needs.', 49.54, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68259640.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Ram Young Corn Thailand 410g', '4800017480507', 'No description found.', 36.21, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/232424823.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Ram Cooked Dry Peas 155g', '4800017905604', 'Make everyday meals more delicious and nutritious with Ram Cooked Dry Peas. It has been properly prepared from clean, sound, succulent green peas. Rich in heart-healthy minerals, magnesium, potassium, and calcium. Just pop open a can to whip up delightful soups, and sauces, or to enhance classic meat and vegetable dishes.', 33.11, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68179150.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Alaska Condensada Sweetened Condensed Creamer 370g', '4800575130302', '• Turn ordinary dishes into delectable family favorite desserts and nutritious treats. • Alaska Condensada Sweetened Condensed Creamer helps Filipino families turn traditional Pinoy desserts such as leche flan, ube halaya, and halo-halo into tasty family favorites.', 94.14, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68188715.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Century Tuna Flakes In Vegetable Oil 180g', '0748485100081', 'Century Tuna Flakes In Oil is a versatile and high-quality canned tuna product, offering tender and flavourful tuna flakes preserved in vegetable oil. This classic preparation enhances the natural taste of the tuna, making it perfect for a variety of dishes such as salads, sandwiches, and pasta. With its rich texture and mild flavour, it’s an excellent choice for quick and nutritious meals. Packaged in a 180g tin, Century Tuna Flakes In Oil is convenient and ready to use straight from the can. Whether you’re preparing a simple lunch or adding protein to your recipes, this tinned tuna provides a delicious and reliable option for any occasion.', 81.66, 34, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/129390021.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Purefoods Chinese Style Luncheon Meat 165g', '4808887030204', 'Savor the taste of the orient the delectable flavor is a result of an exquisite combination of spices, seasoning, and premium meats. Its meat is tender and can be used as a meat substitute for your everyday dishes. It\'s ready to eat and it doesn’t taste very salty. Convenient-fully cooked and ready to eat hot or cold. Get this 1 can (165 grams) of Purefoods Chinese Luncheon Meat.', 95.24, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38266426.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Purefoods Sizzling Delights Sisig 150g', '4808887119480', 'No description found.', 65.66, 8, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/33037010.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
