(2, 1, 'Family S Brand Bonus Pack Sardines In Tomato Sauce Chili 155g', '4806503244097', 'Finest quality, tiny sardines in a popular chili zesty sauce made from tangy, sun-ripened tomatoes. Excellent source of protein and calcium; good source of vitamin D. It is perfectly eaten with steamed rice, pasta, or bread. Contains 1 (155 grams) can of Family Sardines Bonus Pack Plain EOC.', 44.55, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68358418.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
