(2, 1, 'Fortified Star Margarine Classic 250g', '4805358245051', 'Non-refrigerated margarine is made from a special blend of refined oils. It has no cholesterol and no trans fat and is a good source of vitamins A, B1, B2, B6, B12, D3, E, Folic acid, Niacin, and Iodine helping develop tall, healthy, and stand-out kids. Try it with hot rice and make your own Star rice meal today. Get this 1 cup (250 grams) of Star Margarine.', 41.97, 50, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/160794032.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Smart Dishwashing Paste Lemon 200g', '4800045310173', 'Smart Dishwashing Paste with a bright scent of lemon. Cleans and disinfects dishes, pots, pans, kitchen lavatories, and other surfaces. With double tanggaling formula, effectively removes grease, food stains, and bacteria. Sold per cup contains 200 grams of Smart Dishwashing Paste Lemon with a free sponge inside.', 73.65, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215350744.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Quick \'N Easy Mix Sweet & Sour 57g', '4800024570710', 'Cook like an expert with this Quick \'n Easy Sweet and Sour Mix of Del Monte. An all-in-one recipe mix that\'s perfectly blended by Del Monte\'s cooking experts. Each pack is complete with the flavor of real tomatoes, pineapple, and spices. It is expertly capturing the Sweet and Sour flavor you want for your dishes. Sold per 1 pack containing 57 grams of Del Monte Quick N\' Easy Mix Sweet and Sour.', 12.67, 31, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68218349.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Clear Anti-Dandruff Shampoo Complete Soft Care 320ml', '4800888133632', 'Helps replenish protein components, nourishes the scalp, and gives you healthy-looking hair. Removes and prevents dandruff, while keeping hair fresh and fragrant. New liquid fresh gel formula with fast-absorbing anti-dandruff activity. With upgraded triple anti-dandruff technology plus vitamin B3 and amino acid. Get this 1 bottle containing 320ml of Clear Shampoo Complete Soft Care.', 68.79, 29, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68244759.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Carbonara Style Spaghetti Sauce 400g', '4800024584281', 'Enjoy the authentic taste of the delicious easy-to-prepare spaghetti sauce carbonara style of Del Monte. A delicious sauce for those who crave the rich and creamy flavors of carbonara pasta. This sauce is perfect for making snacks or main dishes, pasta dishes for everyday or special occasions. It provides plenty of calcium and magnesium. Sold per pack containing 400 grams of Del Monte Spaghetti Sauce Carbonara Style.', 83.96, 22, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68257519.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Speed Detergent Bar Dagdag Power Whitener 150g', '4806020497525', 'A detergent bar with a whitening agent that helps bring out the whiteness of clothes. Giving you a delightful laundry experience with a fresh scent. Helps the detergent penetrate the dirt from the clothes. Suitable for use on all types of clothes for the whole family.', 67.19, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/155701254.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Magnolia Pancake Creamy & Fluffy Waffle Mix 180g', '4806512230418', 'Have your favorite pancakes for any occasion with Magnolia Pancake & Waffle Mix. It is your quick and easy way to create yummy pancakes and crispy Belgian waffles. Simply add egg, oil, and water to the mix to make your pancakes fluffier. Perfect for snacks that your whole family will surely love.', 11.90, 25, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/83202175.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tresemme Shampoo Keratin Smooth 620ml', '4800888181817', 'No description found.', 12.40, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/53240620.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bear Brand Fortified Powdered Milk Drink', '4800361410816', 'Bear brand fortified powdered milk drink is the only powdered milk that has been studied and proven to have endurance Nutrients that help against micronutrient deficiency. It is more fortified with 3x more available iron based on the impact of the absorption rate. It also provides 100% Vitamin C and high levels of Zinc in each glass. Get this 1 pack (33 grams) of Bear Brand Fortified With Iron Powdered Milk.', 19.46, 31, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243938154.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Colgate Toothpaste Cooling Crystals Spicy 22g 6s', '8850006325223', 'Its extra fresh gel formula is powered with a breakthrough cooling technology for an intense cooling and super fresh experience. Fluoride fights cavities. Fluoride fights cavities. Fresher breath. Whitens Teeth. Healthy gums. Germ protection.', 49.19, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68453603.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mustela Gentle Cleansing Gel 750 Ml', '3504105035471', 'Comprar Banho do Bebé MUSTELA Gentle Cleansing Gel - 750ml. Envios rápidos para Puerto Rico.', 50.38, 36, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/223310243.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Scotch Brite Heavy-Duty Scrub Sponge Trial 1 Scrub Sponge 100mm X 75mm X 30mm', '4800314000118', 'Scotch Brite Scrub is sized right for larger areas and faster results. Perfect for any serious indoor, or outdoor scouring jobs, and dishes. Scrubbing Fibers Made from 100% recycled content. Great for the kitchen, garage, and outdoors. Removes tough, baked-on messes 50% faster than other competitive sponges.', 5.51, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68271424.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Wings Solve Detergent Powder Floral Fresh 60g', '8998866606851', 'Removes dirt and provides a floral scent on clothes that lasts longer. Offers deep cleaning and care of your clothes at the first wash. Suitable for indoor drying with no kulob smell. Making clothes quickly look dull and smelly. Best antibacterial detergent powder. Sold per 1 pack contains 60 grams of Wings Solve Powder Detergent Floral Fresh.', 42.21, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38271810.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Kopiko Black 3in1 Promo Twin 60g', '8998666001702', 'Start your day with the intense kick of Kopiko Coffee. A perfectly balanced blend of strong, rich coffee, smooth creamer, and just the right touch of sweetness. Offer full-bodied flavor and deep aroma. Get this 1 twin pack (60 grams) of Kopiko Black 3in1 Coffee.', 43.40, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68355411.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'UFC Banana Catsup', '0014285000068', 'UFC Banana Catsup is the number one catsup in the Philippines. Best used for spaghetti sauce, fried foods dip sauce, burgers, and many more. Unique blend of fresh spices and select bananas provides the Tamis Anghang flavor. It is versatile, and complementary to a wide selection of dishes whether for dipping, cooking, or marinating.', 35.65, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68256973.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rebisco Hansel Milk Sandwich', '4800092113314', 'No description found.', 77.81, 48, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/37385311.jpg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Hansel Mocha Sandwich', '4800092113291', 'No description found.', 48.52, 26, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/218398877.webp', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16');
