(2, 1, 'W.l. Yaahoo Biscuit Peanut Butter 10g X 12\'s', '4806511010202', 'Flaky and delicious snack crackers with a rich, peanut butter flavor. Great crackers for snacking, appetizers or quick meals. Perfect for the pantry, lunch box, and hiking trail. Sold per pack contains 12 pcs (10 grams each) of W.L.Yaahoo Butter.', 95.05, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68228576.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
