(2, 1, 'Lucky Me Spicy Labuyo Beef Flavor Instant Mami Noodles 50g', '4807770272097', 'Lucky me spicy labuyo chicken has the goodness of fatty beef soup and roasted garlic spiked with a hint of siling labuyo (native chili pepper). Made with flat noodles in light beef broth and topped with green inion scallions. This instant noodle is perfect for family dinners during cold days or a quick meal. A pack of Lucky Me noodles is good for 1/3 of your daily requirement of vitamin a and iron. Get this 1 pack (50 grams) of Lucky Me Instant Noodles Chicken.', 32.79, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68356014.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Robitussin Dm Syrup 120ml', '4800318001883', 'No description found.', 25.27, 35, 'https://st-b.medsgo.ph/images/thumbnails/430/430/detailed/38/ROBITUSSIN_DM_120ML.png.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lysol Disinfectant Spray Early Morning Breeze 170g', '9556111408255', 'Protect your family and keep your house clean with Lysol Disinfectant Spray. Tested and proven to kill 99.9% of viruses and bacteria. Eliminates messes, germs, and odor causing bacteria. Helps to prevent mold and mildew. It leaves a fresh Early Morning Breeze scent after use.', 75.91, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/232519755.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Kool Fever Kids 2\'s', '4987072005538', 'Designed to provide a cooling relief to children experiencing fever. Absorbs and disperses heat effectively when having a fever. Can also be used for headaches, toothache, sprains and bruises, hot days, and flushed skin after sports. For 12 years old and above. Sold per pack containing 2 pieces of Kool Fever Kids.', 5.89, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/156019225.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tang Four Seasons Flavor 25g', '7622300808365', 'Achieve a burst of refreshing flavor with Tang Four Seasons Powder. This 19g packet contains a delightful blend of natural fruit extracts that will invigorate your taste buds. Experience the perfect balance of sweet and tangy notes that will leave you craving for more. Whether you\'re lounging by the pool or hosting a summer barbecue, this versatile powder is the ultimate thirst-quencher. Simply mix with water and enjoy the heavenly taste of four seasons in a single sip. From sunny days to chilly nights, let Tang Four Seasons Powder be your go-to companion for all your beverage cravings.', 19.67, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352650735.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Enchanteur Perfumed Talcum Powder Charming 125g', '8888202018663', 'An international range of perfumes and personal care products, Enchanteur is currently available in 36 countries, and was launched in India some year ago. Powdery soft and refreshing, the Enchanteur Charming Perfumed Talc is designed to make your skin irresistible. It\'s a signature fragrance of citrus zest and roses awakens your senses. Use it and feel fresh and feminine, every day. Enchanteur Charming Perfume strikes a perfect balance between sweet and spunky. The sweet aroma of Roses is laced with Muguet and zesty Citrus Blossoms. The fresh and floral fragrance is designed for a woman who wishes to charm the world!', 11.69, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/41422014.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fiesta Beef Loaf', '4800105202028', 'No description found.', 36.18, 18, 'https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/480/010/520/2028/front_en.3.400.jpg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jolly Whole Mushrooms 400g', '4806014000762', 'Jolly Whole Mushroom is ideal for use in food service or in the home. It is a slightly sweet, earthy flavor with a firm and juicy texture. Instantly enhance pan sauces, red and cream sauces, baked dishes, and more. Simply rinse and drain before enjoying raw or adding to cooked recipes. Perfect for pasta dishes, pizza toppings, soups, and stuffing.', 73.24, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68210313.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lady\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise 220ml', '4800888602268', 'Lady\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise makes sure you give your family the real love that makes everyday food special. Made with real eggs, healthy oils, a rich blend of spices, and other quality ingredients. It has a sour taste with a creamy texture and smells like eggs and mustard. Perfect for cold sauces, salad dressings, sandwich spreads, and fillings.', 56.93, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/329670371.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rexona Women Deodorant Lotion Powder Dry 3mlx360', '4800888158888', 'Feel dry and fresh all day with Rexona Women Deodorant Lotion Powder Dry. Delivers fragrance that goes the distance with you. It gives protection for up to 48 hours from sweat and odor. Women’s antiperspirant deodorant with a long-lasting clean, airy scent. Designed to provide long-lasting protection against body odor and wetness. Sold per tie in 12 sachets containing 3ml in each pack.', 13.52, 8, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215349731.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mafran Banana Catsup SUP 190g', '0014285003816', 'Mafran Banana Catsup Blend is formulated from choice spices, the natural flavor, and the aroma of banana. It is versatile, and complementary to a wide selection of dishes whether for dipping, cooking, or marinating. Best used for spaghetti sauce, fried foods dip sauce, burgers, and many more. It can be used as the secret ingredient to lend that unique sweet flavor.', 35.55, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/231780335.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Today\'s Mixed Fruit 3.03kg', '4800024038548', 'Enjoy a delightful mix of pineapples, papaya, nata de coco and cherries! . A convenient and economical way of giving your family their healthy serving of fruit.', 44.69, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68375022.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bear Brand Fortified Choco Milk Drink', '4800361409117', 'Bear brand fortified choco milk drink is chocolate flavored powdered milk with endurance nutrients equivalent to glass. Strengthening resistance with 100% Vitamin C, Iron, and Zinc to help fight sickness from micronutrient deficiency. Helps with focus with more available Iron to help against Iron deficiency and anemia. With Proper Growth from adequate intake of Zinc and Calcium. Get this 1 pack (29 grams) of Bear Brand Fortified Choco Milk.', 20.21, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89768449.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Al Alali Tomato Paste, 130 G', '0617950600701', 'No description found.', 72.77, 21, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/100014878.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fudgee Barr Milk Custard Cream Filled Vanilla Cake Bar 10 X 39gm', '4800092551291', 'Milk cream wrapped inside a vanilla cake bar. This Fudgee Barr is unquestionably creamy and delicious. 10X42g bars.', 91.70, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/160627557.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nescafe Blend & Brew Original 28gx12s', '4800361403764', 'Enjoy a cup of freshly brewed coffee every morning with Nescafe Original. Has the right blend of sweetness, bitterness, and acidity that most people love. With a pleasant aroma that will help you wake up in the mornings.', 78.33, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68208292.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jimm\'s 3 Plus 1 Coffee Mix With Korean Ginseng Twinpack 40g', '4806509693325', 'Boost your energy and uplift your morning with Jimm\'s 3 Plus 1 Coffee Mix. A 3 plus 1 coffee mix with Korean Ginseng that helps boost energy and improves mental performance, promotes relaxation, reduces stress, and improves sexual dysfunction. Conveniently packaged for easy preparation at home, work, or on the go. Get this 1 piece (40 grams) of Jimm\'s 3 Plus 1 Coffee Mix W/ Korean Ginseng Twinpack.', 53.97, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/155317841.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, '帽子 ハット モチーフストローハット レディース', '3000001315858', 'ZOZO問い合わせ番号:85900821ショップ:Auntie Rosa，アンティローザブランド:NEUNA，ヌナ商品名:モチーフストローハットカテゴリ:帽子&gt;ハットブランド品番:NNMOE242005素材:指定外繊維100%（ヤシの葉）カラー:ベージュサイズ:FREE企画ID:2003930，1974081，1974079，1938887，1938885キーワード:帽子 ハット レディース uvカット 麦わら帽子 夏', 11.56, 16, 'https://z-shopping.c.yimg.jp/821/85900821/85900821b_14_d_500.jpg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti Doy Pack 200mlx60', '4800344004940', 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti promises to make dishes even more delectable with its mild acidity. A delicious ingredient to add to marinades for your favorite meat dishes. Used to attain the right amount of sourness in the meals you prepare. Perfect for use in food preparation, and as an ingredient in popular sauces.', 24.90, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68202319.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Hi-Ro', '4800040342513', 'No description found.', 60.02, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/96328029.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'M.Y. San Grahams Honey Graham Crackers 200gm', '0750515021204', 'Making desserts is now effortless with M.Y. San Grahams! It provides the great taste of Honey Grahams that you\'ll definitely love for your own desserts.', 7.33, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/133121677.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Emi Match Standard 10\'s', '4800112010012', 'Emi match is not your ordinary match with long wooden sticks. Use for fireplace, camping, emergency kit, and many more. Made from quality wood and the carbonized splint size is average. One end is coated with a material that can be ignited by friction generated by striking the match against a suitable surface.', 90.11, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68354997.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Doowee 1pack 10pcs 42g Donut Chocolate', '4800092551604', 'No description found.', 37.06, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/118699354.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Creamsilk Cream Silk Ultimate Reborn Hair Fall Defense Tri-Oleo Conditioner 13ml X 12\'s', '4800888139283', 'Specially designed to make weak and brittle hair stronger from the roots to the tips. Makes hair softer and stronger by reinforcing weak areas and infusing flexibility to help prevent hair fall in just one wash and less breakage. It’s also a long hair conditioner that can help you grow healthy strands. Sold per tie in 12 pieces (13ml each) of Creamsilk Conditioner Hair Fall Defense.', 84.23, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/144417978.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Cleene Absorbent Cotton 10g', '4800067112038', 'Cleene cotton is absorbent and perfect for your skincare needs. Soft and durably made, these ultra-soft balls are gentle on the skin. Perfect to use when applying your favorite toners, makeup removers, and other skincare products. Ideal for cleaning, crafts, and various uses in the home. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 grams of Cleene Absorbent Cotton.', 57.78, 21, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68413273.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bihon Golden Q 200g 48pck Per Sck Nrp PACK', '4806011812276', 'No description found.', 30.71, 15, 'https://go-upc.com/img/no-image-placeholder.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Herbalife Apple iPhone 4 A1332 16GB White (GSM Unlocked)', '4710088412539', 'No description found.', 54.52, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/48263933.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Knorr Broth Cube', '4800888602725', 'Make your favorite meals nutritious and delicious with Knorr Cubes. Made with real pork, this will add delicious pork linamnam to your dishes. A carefully selected blend of herbs and seasonings. Surely make your family appreciate more of your best meal of the day. Sold per 1 piece contains 10 grams each pack.', 50.44, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68267226.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, '5 All Purpose Instant Super Glue', '6937042500189', 'No description found.', 58.65, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/100735218.webp', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Star Margarine Classic Twin Pack 30g', '4805358245150', 'Non-refrigerated margarine is made from a special blend of refined oils. It has no cholesterol and no trans fat and is a good source of vitamins A, B1, B2, B6, B12, D3, E, Folic acid, Niacin, and Iodine helping develop tall, healthy, and stand-out kids. Try it with hot rice and make your own Star rice meal today. Sold per 1 pack contains 30 grams of Star Margarine Classic Twin Pack.', 51.50, 50, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243941419.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Silka Whitening Herbal Soap Papaya 65g', '4806507832481', 'Silka Papaya skin whitening soap is enriched with vitamin E that cleanses and whitens your skin in a natural way. It makes your skin smooth and soft for an all-weather-friendly look. Has a soothing fragrance that keeps you fresh all day long. Keep the lather of soap for 2 minutes on your face and body then rinse off.', 41.60, 4, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215350305.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lion Tiger Mosquito Killer Regular 10 Coils', '4800101008884', 'Lion Tiger provides you with the protection you need for a night of good sleep disturbance from annoying mosquitoes. Easy to use and very effective. Protects your family from mosquitoes for up to 8 hours. Do not store food, household utensils, or clothing.', 17.91, 31, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68301928.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mafran All Purpose Dressing Orange SUP 200g', '4801668606865', 'A versatile companion that enhances a wide range of dishes. Its distinct sweet and sour taste is sure to enhance the flavor of your all-time favorite. With its lively and zesty notes, it encourages you to explore new taste horizons. Sold per pack containing 200 grams of Mafran All Purpose Dressing Orange.', 56.93, 48, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68259688.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Wipe Cotton Buds Plastic 200 Tips', '4800067072011', 'The cotton buds for ears at both ends are soft, absorbent, and not easy to break. Ideal for gently cleaning around the outer surface of the ear, and for a variety of beauty and personal care uses. Dual-sided with a rounded tip and a precise tip to cater to all your beauty needs. Get this 1 pack (200 pieces) of Wipe Cotton Buds Plastic.', 11.53, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68255194.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Combino Dough Shellfish', '4056489844921', 'No description found.', 97.70, 44, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/92687764.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fidel Iodized Salt Refined 250g', '4806011900065', 'Salt is a flavoring agent and is used as a food preservative. Used for cooking to impart saltiness, enhance flavor and stimulate taste. Essential for your body to function correctly, and it\'s essential for good health. Helps prevent iodine deficiency and thyroid problems. Creates the hormones that regulate heart rate and blood pressure.', 43.49, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68266866.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Ajinomoto Crispy Fry Breading Mix Original', '4801958390108', 'Make every bite extra crunchy with Ajinomoto Crispy Fry. Specially made to give fried dishes a deliciously crisp texture. Perfectly seasons and coats up to 1kg of meat. Easy to use for quick and tasty home-cooked meals. Brings out the best flavor in chicken, pork, or seafood. Get this 1 pack (62 grams) of Ajinomoto Crispy Fry Breading Mix Original.', 38.09, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352618271.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Off Overtime Insect Repellent Lotion 6ml', NULL, 'Discover the ultimate secret to long-lasting protection with Off Lotion. Provides up to 8-hour continuous protection from Dengue-carrying mosquitoes. With DermCool formula feels cool and light on your skin, perfect for daily use. It feels pleasant on the skin, it does not itch, and it is not sticky. Sold per sachet contains 6ml of Off Lotion Overtime.', 23.24, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/228827334.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Royal Royal Tru Orange Zero Sugar 1.5l Carbonated Drinks', '4801981096435', 'No description found.', 89.78, 26, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/204654828.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Selecta Ice Cream 3in1 Choco Keso Ube Mango 1.5L', '4800086047717', 'Birthdays are made special with Creamdae 3 in 1+1. 4 delicious flavors in a 1.5L tub featuring chocolate, keso, ube, and mango. Perfect for any occasion that the whole family will surely love. Ice cream is rich in carbohydrates, fats, and proteins, which are all needed for our bodies to produce energy.', 87.73, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243350385.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rebisco Party Mix Biscuit Medley 1.68kg', '4800092111280', 'Here comes the perfect mate for dipping into the coffee. Experience the variety taste of classy cookies you want in one plastic box. Choose among the wide variety of assorted baked biscuits/cookies. Toasted into crunchy perfection with a slight touch of sweetness in each bite. Surely young ones & young ones will both love and crave this Filipino native snack. Get this 1 container (1.68 kg) of Rebisco Party Mix Biscuit.', 49.88, 50, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38253479.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Selecta 2in1 Double Dutch Cookies And Cream 1.3L', '4800086040671', 'Treat your loved ones to delicious yummy ice cream by Selecta Double Supreme. Two delicious ice cream flavors in one. Vanilla ice cream with cashews, chocolate chips, and marshmallows. Vanilla ice cream with chocolate cookie bits. This convenient ice cream provides a perfect moment for your family and friends. Sold per tub contains 1.3 liters of Selecta Ice Cream 2-In-1 Double Dutch + Cookies And Cream.', 49.05, 22, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68262679.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Champion 1 Todo Bar 130g + 1 Powder Sachet 35g Detergent Powder Todo Tipid Pack', '4806501703503', 'No description found.', 74.12, 18, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38263329.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'C2 Green Tea Apple Solo 230ml', '4800016068010', 'Relax the natural way with C2 cool and clean made from 100% natural green tea leaves. Naturally refreshing tea drink that helps keep you healthy, and gives you well-deserved relaxing moments. Rich in essential antioxidants and delicately brewed and bottled on the same day. Enjoy the refreshingly fruity goodness of C2 Green Tea Apple.', 57.78, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/164974608.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tanduay Rhum Dark Five Years 375mL', '4800220503253', 'Elevate any occasion with Tanduay Rhum. A unique blend of cane spirits derived from choice sugarcane blended to a suave 60 proof. It holds the true character of true Asian rum buoyed by more than a century and a half of creative innovation and foresight. This rhum reflects the hallmark of Tanduay’s rich and lively heritage. Get this 1 bottle (375mll) of Tanduay Rhum 5 Years.', 21.81, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68327078.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jumpee Cream Filled Snacks Chocolate Flavor 35g', '4800092660047', 'Delicious creamy chocolate-flavored filling in mini crisp wafer bites. The light crunch and choco flavors of Jumpee creme-filled wafers are the perfect complements to milk or ice cream. Great snack food for the office, lunch boxes, post-workout, or breakfast on the go. Get this 1 pack (35 grams) of Jumpee Snax Choco.', 85.36, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225998.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, '28 G', '4807770101533', 'No description found.', 16.63, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/93324776.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lady\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise Regular 700ml', '4808680021553', 'Lady\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise makes sure you give your family the real love that makes everyday food special. Made with real eggs, healthy oils, a rich blend of spices, and other quality ingredients. It has a sour taste with a creamy texture and smells like eggs and mustard. Perfect for cold sauces, salad dressings, sandwich spreads, and fillings. Get this 1 bottle containing 700ml of Lady\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise Regular.', 38.73, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68212664.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Creamline Creamy Ice Cream Buco Salad 1.3L', '4806514104403', 'No description found.', 77.19, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89373324.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bear Brand Fortified Powdered Milk Drink', '4800361410892', 'Make every day a tasty and healthy one with Bear Brand Powdered Milk. Made of cow\'s milk, packed with essential nutrients. Perfect for a quick and delicious energy boost any time of the day.', 8.96, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38257818.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Red Horse Beer 1L', '4801032211138', 'Red Horse Beer Litro, a robust libation that boasts a net content of 1000 ml, packing a punch with 6.9% alcohol per volume. Crafted with precision by the esteemed San Miguel Brewery Inc., this beverage is not for the faint-hearted. Dive into a world of flavor where every sip delivers an unparalleled experience. Red Horse Beer Litro is expertly brewed to perfection, offering a distinctive full-flavored profile that tantalizes the taste buds with its rich complexity. But what truly sets this brew apart is its extra-satisfying strength. With a formidable alcohol content, Red Horse Beer Litro ensures that every moment spent indulging in its bold essence is nothing short of exhilarating. So, whether you\'re unwinding after a long day or seeking an adventure in taste, reach for Red Horse Beer Litro and elevate your drinking experience to new heights.', 66.53, 17, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/349661488.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Best Foods Mayo Magic All-Purpose Dressing SUP 220ml', '4808680027159', 'Best Food Mayo makes sure you give your family the real love that makes everyday food special. Made with real eggs, healthy oils, a rich blend of spices, and other quality ingredients. It has a sour taste with a creamy texture and smells like eggs and mustard. Perfect for cold sauces, salad dressings, sandwich spreads, and fillings.', 74.36, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68303666.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rebisco Bravo Biscuits With Sesame Seeds 10s', '4800092110115', 'Bravo biscuits are packed with unique flavors in each bite. Its sweet-salty taste comes from a blend of sugar and sesame seeds. Each biscuit is high in Vitamins B1, B2, and E. Perfect for snacks and those on the go. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 pieces of Rebisco Bravo Cracker Biscuit.', 5.09, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68227286.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Argentina Corned Beef 260g', '0748485800035', 'Argentina Corned Beef is deliciously flavorful, has meaty strands, and is packed with protein. Made with 100% pure beef and fortified with zinc and iron to help boost immunity. Fully cooked, ready-to-eat corned beef. Get this 1 can (260 grams) of Argentina Corned Beef.', 18.47, 5, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/129391442.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nescafe Nescafé Classic Instant Coffee', '4800361393645', 'Nescafe brings you the best-tasting classic ever. This is the new double filter technology of Nescafe coffee. Nescafe Classic comes from 100% pure, high-quality coffee beans. Discover the full flavor of Nescafe classic for an invigorating to start your day.', 96.20, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68208277.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
