(2, 1, 'Fudgee Barr Bar Chocolate Cake', '4800092550911', 'Chocolate cream wrapped inside a chocolate cake bar. This Fudgee Barr is unquestionably creamy and delicious.', 47.20, 23, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225924.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nescafe Classic REFILL 23g', '4800361339186', 'Start your day right with the first sips of this Nescafe Classic. It is a 100% pure and natural instant coffee. Has a medium-dark roast that gives it a full flavor and wonderfully refreshing taste. The unmistakable taste and aroma we all know and love are still as good as ever.', 84.72, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/139567296.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Summit Natural Drinking Water 1L', '4800014142088', 'The official bottled water of the Philippine National Athletes. It has minerals to boost their hydration level. This product is purified and processed through state-of-the-art equipment. It comes in an environment-friendly bottle to help save the environment. Helps dissolve minerals and nutrients, making them more accessible to the body. Get this 1 bottle contains 1000ml of Summit Mineral Water.', 75.82, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68214757.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Legendary Foods 20g Protein Tasty Pastry - Chocolate Cake', '0810035970700', 'Each pastry has 20g of protein, 170 calories, and just 5g net carbs! Let your childhood taste buds run free and enjoy the guilt-free flavor of these incredible cake-style pastries! Enjoy it lightly microwaved or straight out of the wrapper. Your Legendary experience awaits.', 69.10, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/302966981.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Max Staple Wire #35', '4902870766290', 'Keep important documents securely fastened with Max Staple Wire. Used for stapling documents, securing upholstery fabric to furniture frames, attaching carpeting or insulation, and fastening thick layers of materials together. Perfect piece of office gear to tackle all your organizational needs. The convenient, storage box contains 5,000 staples for long-term dependability.', 21.53, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/244144820.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Kraft Eden Filled Cheese 165g', '4808647020094', 'Eden gives your recipes a distinct rich creaminess for mealtimes made with love. It has vitamins A, B2, and Calcium. Best for creamy dishes. Tasty and yummy.', 78.24, 22, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68185111.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fudgee Barr Bar Vanilla Cake', '4800092551376', 'Fudgee Barr Vanilla is a fun way to satiate your sweet tooth. Inside-out goodness with rich, creamy, and mouth-watering fillings of vanilla. This bar cake is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per 1 pack contains 10 pieces (39 grams each) of Fudgee Barr Vanilla.', 83.74, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352623158.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'IPI Aceite De Manzanilla 100mL', '4800011159041', 'Aceite manzanilla is the Spanish name for the oil-based form of chamomile in Latin America. It is often used as an antiflatulent to help relieve stomach pain. Apply a generous amount of oil externally and rub gently over the affected area as often as desired.', 77.87, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68255275.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Jack \'n Jill Maxx Dalandan Orange Menthol Candy 200g', '4800016303081', 'Jack \'n Jill Maxx Candy Dalandan Orange is a small, round candy with a tangy and fruity flavor that combines the taste of dalandan, a Filipino citrus fruit, and orange. The right blend of menthol and sweetness makes you feel confident as it cools, soothes, and freshens your breath in an instant. A citrusy way of enjoying your day with this hard candy. The candy comes in a pack of 50 pieces, making it perfect for sharing with family and friends.', 16.88, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/34323470.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Argentina Beef Loaf 150G', '0748485800738', 'Made from quality meat that’s seasoned with the most flavorful yet kid-friendly spice. Delicious beef loaf canned food that\'s bursting with flavor. Fully cooked and ready to serve hot or cold. 1 can (150grams) of Argentina Beef Loaf.', 10.80, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68355397.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Scotch Brite Stainless Steel Ball 30g', '4800314007926', 'No description found.', 44.41, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68271428.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fudgee Barr Macapuno Cake Bar 10 X 42gm 420gm', '4800092551451', 'Fudgee Barr Macapuno is a fun way to satiate your sweet tooth. Inside-out goodness with rich, creamy, and mouth-watering fillings of Macapuno. This bar cake is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking.', 37.62, 2, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/129436032.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lucky Me Instant Noodles Seafood Shrimp Tonkotsu 60g', '4807770274459', 'Savor the rich and flavorful taste of Lucky Me Instant Noodles. Seafood shrimp tonkotsu in pork bone broth flavor for a creamy and savory taste. Quick and easy to prepare—perfect for a satisfying meal anytime. Get this 1 piece (60 grams) of Lucky Me Instant Noodles Seafood Shrimp Tonkotsu.', 6.08, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/392481924.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Quickchow Quick Chow Instant Mami Chicken 55g', '4804888889018', 'Experience chicken noodle soup Filipino-style. Made with flat noodles in light chicken broth and topped with egg flakes, enjoy chicken mami (noodle soup) in an instant. This instant noodle is perfect for family dinners during cold days or a quick meal. A pack of Lucky Me noodles is good for 1/3 of your daily requirement of vitamin a and iron. Get this 1 pack (55 grams) of Quick Chow Noodles Chicken.', 67.90, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68265176.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16');
