(2, 1, 'Quickchow Instant Mami Beef Flavor 55g', '4804888889025', 'Quick chow beef lets you experience noodle goodness that captures the true taste of beef - delicately boiled, light, and oh-so yummy. Made with flat noodles in light beef broth, enjoy beef mami (noodle soup) in an instant. This instant noodle is perfect for family dinners during cold days or a quick meal. A pack of quick chow noodles is good for 1/3 of your daily requirement of vitamin a and iron. Get this 1 pack (55 grams) of Quick Chow Noodles Beef.', 26.46, 36, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38261672.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
