(2, 1, 'Coca-Cola Coke Swakto 190ml', '4801981127177', 'Energize your senses with Coke. Best enjoyed cold for maximum refreshment. Perfect drink in the afternoon, on the go, with your meal, or any time. Good for parties, meals, and celebrations big and small. Get this 1 bottle (190ml) of Coke Swakto.', 68.08, 29, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68261391.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
