(2, 1, 'Handy Stitch Handheld Sewing Machine', '4250847135779', '✂ PERFECT FOR ANY MATERIALS▹ This universal small sewing machine apply to all kinds of fabrics which is great for silks, denim, wool, leather and crafts. Also very suitable for craft, patchwork or simple embroidery. You can use this practical machine to make your own handkerchiefs, aprons, gloves, cloth, pet clothes and so on. ✂ SAVE YOUR TIME▹ This electric handheld single stitch sewing machine makes it so much faster and easier than using a needle, saving you time and money. Fix hems, mend a torn pocket or shorten trousers, all within minutes. ✂ SIMPLE IN USE▹ This mini sewing machine is easy to operate, line with the flat edge, automatic moving. Please read the instructions carefully before using it. Both beginner and professionals can make some DIY arts crafts easily. Also is a good partner for training children\'s working habits and sewing skills. ✂ PORTABLE DESIGN▹ Great for travelling as it is compact and lightweight, it can be battery operated to make it absolutely portable or you can use it with a power adaptor (the required 4 x AA batteries or DC6V power adaptor are not included). Compact and lightweight, Portable and easy to carry around. Sewing repair anywhere. ✂ HIGH-QUALITY&LOW NOISE▹ The high-quality plastic materials were used for these handheld sewing machines manufacturing which precisely controls stitching with the rotary wheel adjustment and it has tension control to adjust the tightness of stitches, the fastening plate holds the fabric while stitching; high-quality and low noise, making your work more efficient.', 16.06, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/93045423.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Selecta Bestsellers 2-in-1 Cookies & Cream + Double Dutch 750mL', '4800086040688', 'Treat your loved ones to delicious yummy ice cream by Selecta Double Supreme. Two delicious ice cream flavors in one. Vanilla ice cream with cashews, chocolate chips, and marshmallows. Vanilla ice cream with chocolate cookie bits. This convenient ice cream provides a perfect moment for your family and friends. Sold per tub contains 750 ml of Selecta Ice Cream Double Dutch + Cookies And Cream.', 85.51, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68262539.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Powered by Lightspeed Greenex All Purpose Cleaner Original 250ml', '4800047840845', 'No description found.', 71.16, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/329689716.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rexona Motion Sense Passion Deo-Lotion 3ml', '4800888151100', 'Feel dry and fresh all day with Rexona Women Deodorant Lotion Passion. Delivers fragrance that goes the distance with you. It gives protection for up to 48 hours from sweat and odor. Women’s antiperspirant deodorant with a long-lasting clean, airy scent. Designed to provide long-lasting protection against body odor and wetness. Sold per tie in 12 pieces containing 3ml in each pack.', 73.42, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/53229423.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bear Brand Nestlé Adult Plus Milk Drink With Coffee 33g', '4800361403993', 'Boost your morning with the goodness of Bear Brand Adult Plus. A coffee-flavored powdered milk drink specially formulated for adults. High source of calcium and vitamin D for the maintenance of normal bones and is high in iron and zinc for the normal function of the immune system. Sold per 1 sachet contains 33 grams of Bear Brand Adult Plus Milk With Coffee.', 45.56, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/229345990.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Wizact24 Disinfecting Spray & Clean Original 450ml', '8998866617260', 'No description found.', 95.89, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38099739.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Casino Ethyl Alcohol 70% Solution Antiseptic Disinfectant 150mL', '4800011121512', 'Casino Ethyl Alcohol is a disinfectant, sterilizer, cleanser, and general antiseptic for everyday all-around use. It has a 70% ethyl alcohol solution for germ fighting. Concentrated bacteria-fighting agents are stronger than the leading national brands. Convenient portable travel-size hand sanitizer for travel, car, home, and office. It contains glycerine which helps retain skin moisture.', 2.92, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89782514.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Top Cafe Café Brown Delight Complete Coffee Mix 25g', '8998866808774', 'Top Cafe is made of high quality of Arabica and Robusta beans Each sachet is made of from coffee beans that are carefully selected and roasted. It deliver the perfect coffee taste and aroma. Has a right Balance of Coffee taste and sweetness of brown sugar Has the caramelly aroma and balance taste of 3n1 coffee.', 83.40, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68496355.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Bear Brand Adult Plus Powdered Milk Drink', '4800361396677', 'Enjoy the taste of real milk with all the added benefits in just one serving with Bear Brand. A powdered milk drink specially formulated for adults 19-29 years old. Has adult strength nutrients such as 100% B-Vitamins (B1, B2, B3, B6, and B12) that help reduce tiredness and fatigue by releasing energy from the food you eat. Get this 1 pack (33 grams) of Bear Brand Adult Plus Milk.', 49.37, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68208307.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti 20ml X 12\'s', '4800344004926', 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti promises to make dishes even more delectable with its mild acidity. A delicious ingredient to add to marinades for your favorite meat dishes. Used to attain the right amount of sourness in the meals you prepare. Perfect for use in food preparation, and as an ingredient in popular sauces.', 78.50, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68202380.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tide With A Freshness Of Downy Garden Bloom Bar 380g', '4902430411509', 'Tide detergents contain strong stain removal power to remove the most stubborn stain on clothes but at the same time, it is gentle on clothes. A long-lasting detergent bar that removes stains from clothes. It cleans your garment as it removes dirt even on tough areas like cuffs and collars. Color care technology keeps whites bright and clothes looking new. Tide ensures to deliver you the cleanest clothes. Get this 1 bar (380 grams) of Tide Bar With Freshness of Downy.', 38.20, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352248036.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Kopiko Black 3 In 1 Coffee Mix 10 X 30g', '8996001410226', 'Start your day with the intense kick of Kopiko Coffee. A perfectly balanced blend of strong, rich coffee, smooth creamer, and just the right touch of sweetness. Offer full-bodied flavor and deep aroma. Get this 1 piece (30 grams) of Kopiko Black 3in1 Coffee.', 10.24, 27, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68373848.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rexona Deodorant Lotion Quantum 3ml X 12\'s', '4800888151117', 'Feel dry and fresh all day with Rexona Deo Lotion Quantum. Delivers fragrance that goes the distance with you. It gives protection for up to 48 hours from sweat and odor. Women’s antiperspirant deodorant with a long-lasting clean, airy scent. Designed to provide long-lasting protection against body odor and wetness. Sold per tie in 12 sachets containing 3ml in each pack.', 41.74, 22, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/38259712.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Avene Sunscreen Spray For Children 200 Ml', '3282770202090', 'The Spray SPF 50+ for Children offers ideal sun protection with its anti-aggressor barrier formula designed for sensitive skin. Featuring a fluid, light texture, it forms a durable protective film resistant to water. At its core is the Sunsitive protection complex by Pierre Fabre Research, combining four sun filters for broad UVB-UVA protection, Provitamin E for antioxidant defense against free radicals, and Av猫ne Thermal Spring Water to soothe and soften skin. The convenient OPEN/STOP system enhances usability and environmental friendliness. Apply generously before sun exposure, reapplying frequently, especially after water activities, for continuous protection.', 91.87, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/305378328.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Vaseline Lotion Essential Even Tone 120ml', '6281006506572', 'Vaseline Skin Brightening Essential Even Tone Lotion is an effective product for improving skin tone and brightening. Benefits and features:. It lightens skin tone naturally and effectively. It helps unify skin tone and reduce discoloration. It deeply moisturizes the skin and gives it a soft and silky texture. It protects the skin from dryness and maintains its natural balance. It contains ingredients that nourish the skin and enhance its health. It absorbs quickly without leaving any greasy or heavy feeling on the skin.', 60.96, 11, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/145275670.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16');
