(2, 1, 'Johnson\'s Baby Powder Blossoms Pink 50g', '4801010105107', 'Johnson\'s Blossom baby powder will give your baby long-lasting freshness and skin comfort. Carefully made to keep your newborn comfortable and has passed over 30 safety and quality tests. With improved formula. Clinically proven mild and hypoallergenic. Dermatologist and allergy-tested.', 22.47, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68163097.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
