(2, 1, 'Wipe Cotton Buds Plastic 72 Tips', '4800067112991', 'The cotton buds for ears at both ends are soft, absorbent, and not easy to break. Ideal for gently cleaning around the outer surface of the ear, and for a variety of beauty and personal care uses. Dual-sided with a rounded tip and a precise tip to cater to all your beauty needs. Get this 1 pack (72 pcs) of Wipe Cotton Buds Plastic.', 4.02, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68255712.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
