(2, 1, 'Gatorade Sports Drink Blue Bolt 350mL', '4803925350054', 'Boost your energy with Gatorade Energy Drink. A sports drink specifically formulated for athletes. Helps restore lost body fluids and provides energy to the working muscles. Get this 1 bottle (350ml) of Gatorade Energy Drink Blue Bolt.', 48.73, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68261168.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
