(2, 1, 'IPI Aceite De Manzanilla 25ml', NULL, 'A chamomile base oil long known trusted high quality and affordable product. Used as an antiflatulent to help relieve stomach pain. Helps to relieve nausea. Each solution contains manzanilla oil, mineral oil, and coloring to add. Sold per 1 bottle contains 25ml of IPI Manzanilla Oil.', 59.94, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/228874921.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nissin Wafer Yummy Butter 12g X 20\'s', '4807770120237', 'Satisfy your sweet cravings with an all-time family favorite delicious snack that hits the spot. This butter wafer snack is made with crispy wafers filled with yummy butter creme. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This wafer is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per 1 pack contains 20 pieces (12 grams each) of Nissin Wafer Yummy Butter.', 94.64, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68474469.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Kojie San Kojic Acid Skin Lightening Soap', '4809013300017', 'Kojie San\'s formulation blends effective ingredients with nourishing coconut oil and a fresh orange fragrance will have your skin looking its best. Powerful, natural ingredients reduce the appearance of age spots, hyperpigmentation, melasma, freckles, red marks, scars, and other signs of sun damage. Zero Pigment Light is a unique skin-lightening delivery system that effectively bonds the potent active ingredient to ensure that it is absorbed by and activated in your skin and areas where it is most needed. Get this 1 bar containing 135 grams of Kojiesan Skin Lightening Soap.', 49.72, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352341305.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fudgee Barr Chocolate Cake Bar With Salted Caramel', '4800092553257', 'Fudgee Barr has rich moist cake and delicious cream filling that mimics a real Salted Caramel cake experience. It provides delight, making it as a source of simple joy and happiness for everyone.', 83.86, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/160628806.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Puresnack Kapitan Tuna 50g', '4806510787266', 'These are the tasty tuna-flavored crunchy and crispy chips. Make a great snack food for both kids and adults. Perfect for hanging out with friends or enjoying yourself on your own. Get this 1 pack containing 50 grams of Puresnack Kapitan tuna.', 36.86, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225814.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Sisters Overnight Protect Menstrual Pants Medium 2\'s', '4806506316760', 'Experience worry-free overnight sleep with Sister\'s Overnight Menstrual Pants. Designed with a breathable back sheet with non-woven cotton for maximum softness and comfort. Long absorbent core with a 3D design flow guide that gives ultimate protection against leakage. Allows unrestricted movement and prevents side and back leakage. Get these 2 pieces of Sister\'s Overnight Protect Menstrual Pants in one pouch.', 36.68, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/393614621.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Garnier Skin Active Micellar Water Vitamin C - 100ml', '3600542404235', 'Enriched with micelles, highly efficient make-up remover and Vitamin C, it removes any kind of make-up,eliminates pollution and dirt, gives brightness and glow in one step. Shake and apply onto the face, eyes and lips with soaked cotton pads without rubbing and without rinsing.', 56.11, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/354904492.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Casino Ethyl Alcohol Regular Solution - 50ml', NULL, 'Casino Ethyl Alcohol is a disinfectant, sterilizer, cleanser, and general antiseptic for everyday all-around use. It has a 70% ethyl alcohol solution for germ fighting. Concentrated bacteria-fighting agents are stronger than the leading national brands. Convenient portable travel-size hand sanitizer for travel, car, home, and office. It contains glycerine which helps retain skin moisture.', 26.93, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/345145309.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Johnson\'s Baby Bath Milk + Rice Pump 1000ml', '9556006060025', 'Avoid sharing soap with your babies and protect their soft and gentle skin with Johnson’s Milk + Rice Bath. Baby’s skin is 30% thinner than adult skin making it perfect for babies. It has the no more tear formula and is clinically proven mild and gentle to the eyes. Grab your 1000-ml refill pack now. About Johnson and Johnson. Johnson and Johnson is a company founded in 1886 by three Johnson brothers namely Robert Wood, James Wood, and Edward Mead Johnson in New Brunswick, New Jersey, USA. The company becomes the pioneer in first aid kits. Today, the company is a big player in the industry offering various products from consumer to medical to pharmaceutical.', 97.76, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/354286410.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Maybelline Base Fit Me Fresh Tint SPF50 - 30 G', '6902395830528', 'Say hello to the all-new makeup Tint + skincare. Fit Me Fresh Tint delivers a fresh, bright look + feel. This skin tint foundation with SPF 50 is infused with Vitamin C. Its kind-to-skin formula glides on to brighten and transform for a fresh natural finish for all. Available in 4 shades.', 6.01, 34, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/123218518.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lucky Me Go Cup Mini Instant Noodles Batchoy 40g', '4807770271168', 'Delight in the mouthwatering meaty goodness of Lucky me go cup batchoy. Great for those on the go and perfect as a soothingly simple, after-school snack. This product offers the tastiness of batchoy, a scrumptious noodle soup that traces its origin in batchoy, Iloilo City. Complete with pork crackling and meat bits. Batchoy (Pork liver soup) lets you enjoy the taste of the well loved philippine delicacy everyday. It has no artificial preservatives added, and uses natural green tea extract. Get this 1 cup (40 grams) of Lucky Me Mini Noodles Batchoy.', 25.38, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68356193.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Sisters Napkin Day + Night With Wings 8s', '4806506311079', 'Silky top sheet for softness and comfort. With super gel that turns liquid into gel instantly. 8 individually wrapped sanitary napkins. Recommended for light flow and daytime use. 240 mm long with wings. Sisters Sanitary Napkin Net Side:. Perforated top sheet for a cooler and drier feeling. Four wall shields to prevent side and end leaks. Powder detergent for cleaning white and colored laundry. With Super Gel that turns liquid into gel instantly. Best for medium to heavy flow. 280 with wings, individually wrapped.', 19.09, 18, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68267693.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, '555 Sardines In Tomato Sauce Hot Red 155g', '0748485200026', 'Bring out the chef in you and discover a lot of dishes with these yummy sardines (Sardinas). Try 555 Sardines In Tomato Sauce Hot.', 25.22, 8, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/369088588.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Downy Fabric Conditioner Garden Bloom 38ml', '4902430452694', 'Worry less about the unpleasant odor with Downy Fabric Conditioner Garden Bloom. Downy fights against tough bad smells with anti-odor ingredients. Give long-lasting freshness and make your clothes soft. Suitable for top-loading and front-loading washing machines. Helps to protect fabrics from stretching, discoloration, and fluffing. This will freshen all of your laundries at home with just one cap.', 98.39, 23, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/66586657.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Downy Fabric Conditioner Sunrise Fresh 26ml 6\'s + 1', '4902430846417', 'Worry less about the unpleasant odor with Downy Fabric Conditioner Sunrise Fresh. Downy fights against tough bad smells with anti-odor ingredients. Give long-lasting freshness and make your clothes soft. Suitable for top-loading and front-loading washing machines. Helps to protect fabrics from stretching, discoloration, and fluffing.', 33.50, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89339025.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mega Corned Sardines In Tomato Sauce With Chili 155g', '4806504710928', 'Taste the freshness of Mega Corned Sardine, caught and packed straight into the can, seasoned with chili tomato sauce. The rich tomato sauce provides lycopene, the strongest antioxidant that helps cell against aging and help to control blood pressure. Its hot and spicy sauce adds a fiery kick and robust flavor. Time to spice up your cooking with this Mega Corned Sardine. Sold per 1 can contain 155 grams of Mega Corned Sardines In Tomato Sauce Chili.', 41.99, 11, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/126080740.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Ceres Venus Tawas Powder Perfume 288x40g PC', '4809012730716', 'It is hypoallergenic, easily washable, it is not an antiperspirant thus it does not clog the skin pores. . It works by eliminating the odor-causing bacteria so the body would not smell while maintaining the natural way of sweating. . Antiperspirant tawas powder is used as a deodorizer for foot, and underarms. . It is a safe natural way to control body odor or deodorant. . Get this 1 cup (25 grams) of Ceres Tawas Powder With Perfume.', 87.38, 34, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68451871.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mega Sardines Tomato Sauce 425g', '4806504710348', 'The freshest and most delicious sardines with savory tomato sauce. Rich in Vitamin D, Omega-3 and Calcium. Fully cooked and ready for a fast, easy, convenient, healthy meal for any time and on the go. Contains 1 (425 grams) can of Mega Sardines Tomato Sauce.', 73.29, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/232138383.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nike Court Vision Low Next Nature - Mens', '0195237031351', 'In love with the classic look of \'80s basketball but have a thing for the fast-paced culture of today\'s game? Meet the Nike Court Vision Low. A classic remixed with at least 20% recycled materials by weight, its crisp upper and stitched overlays keep the soul of the original style. The plush, low-cut collar keeps it sleek and comfortable for your world. Made with at least 20% recycled material by weight. Whenever you see the Nike Sunburst or the name Next Nature (NN), you see one more step on our journey toward zero carbon and zero waste. Using synthetic materials, the design features materials that echo mid-1980s basketball shoes. Padded, low-cut collar looks sleek and feels great while the perforations on the toe and sides add comfort and breathability.', 97.13, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/60770560.webp', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Modess Regular Cottony Soft Cover Non-Wing 12 Pads', '8850007371441', 'Keep your day more comfortable with Modess Maxi Regular Cottony Soft Wings. Designed to keep you dry for that clean and fresh feeling. Control menstrual odor and help you feel clean and dry. Provides discreet protection during your period. Helps catch fluid from the front, back, and side for all-around leak protection.', 76.76, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/161064466.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Charmee Feminine Pads All Flow Cottony Soft With Wings 8\'s', '4800488011415', 'Have these Charmee Feminine Pads for that unique protection and comfort combination in every use. It has a micro dimple cover and quick absorption plus leak control channels. Super-absorbent gel to lock liquid in. Helps to avoid back leaks for all types of flow protection. Peel off the adhesive cover and place it into the underwear.', 75.27, 36, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/35217788.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Chuckie Nestlé My Chocolatey Buddy Chocolate Milk Drink 110mL', '4800361395687', 'Treat yourself to creamy choco-vanilla goodness in every sip with Nestle Chuckie. The coolest, most fun-to-drink beverage brand among Filipino kids today. It is a sterilized recombined and homogenized high-grade chocolate-flavored milk fortified with Calci-N, for stronger bones. Nourish your body with the chocolatey goodness. Get this 1 piece (110ml) of Nestle Chuckie Calci N.', 30.24, 18, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68372555.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Starwax Red Floorwax 90g', '4800045320059', 'Star Wax gives your floors a superior, waterproof shine that lasts longer. Contains red color that is easy to use, and fast-drying. Good to use on different floor types like wood, cement, red cement, marble, and parquet. Sold per 1 can contains 90 grams of Star Wax Red.', 88.18, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/230167532.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Alaska Evaporada Evaporated Creamer - 140ml', '4800575140158', 'Alaska Evaporada helps Filipino families turn traditional Pinoy desserts into tasty family favorites. It is an evaporated creamer that is often a key ingredient in creating and enhancing the taste of various food and beverages. Each can of Alaska Evaporada has the creaminess and taste housewives look for.', 94.32, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68189705.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Atami Sardines Hot 155g', '4806503248026', 'A delightful and flavorful seafood choice that combines the natural goodness of sardines marinated in spicy tomato sauce. Excellent source of omega-3 fatty acids, protein, and essential vitamins and minerals. Fuel your inner hunger and excite your taste buds. Sold per 1 tin can contains 155 grams of Atami Sardines Hot.', 89.37, 11, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68380568.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Alpine Full Cream Evaporated Milk 154ml', '4800575884502', 'Made from whole cow’s milk, contains increased levels of Vitamins A and D. Can be used as an ingredient for cooking or enjoyed as a milk drink. It enhances the taste of both savory and sweet recipes, adding luscious creaminess and richness.', 40.12, 17, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/229286575.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Alaska Condensada Sweetened Condensed Creamer 216g', '4800575130166', 'No description found.', 48.99, 21, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/160088333.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Absolute Distilled Water 6L', '4800014700004', 'Absolute is 100% distilled water and the trusted drinking water for the family. Choose the trustworthy #1 Distilled Water Brand in the Philippines. The cleanest and safest water for your baby and family. It has undergone thorough purification and distillation process. The distillation process removes fluoride and natural minerals found in drinking water. Get this 1 bottle contains 6 liters of Absolute Distilled Water.', 60.81, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68266850.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Pineapple Tidbits 115g', '4800024570611', 'Try pineapple tidbits stirred into vegetable side dishes, pasta, or rice salads or as a dessert topping that you will surely love it. Great tasting pineapples from the best of farms in the Philippines. Packed straight from the fields to taste the best when consumed. Evenly cut slices make serving better.', 5.39, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68355821.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Dove Shampoo Straight And Silky 12ml X 12\'s', '4800888212917', 'New Dove Straight and Silky Shampoo upgraded with Keratin Tri-Silk Serum. Has Amino Essence, an essential amino acid to boost hair health for deep nourishment up to the core of your hair fibers. Patented Micro Moisture Serum nourishes your hair to repair damaged hair cuticles that cause misbehaving fluffy hair. For extra straight, smooth, and shiny hair, choose the Dove Silky Shampoo. Sold per dozen in 12 sachets contains 12ml of Dove Shampoo Straight and Silky.', 46.22, 26, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215341148.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Primo Mart Selecta 3In1 1 Choco Keso Ube Buco Salad 1.5L', '4800086045928', 'No description found.', 20.60, 23, 'https://primomart.ph/cdn/shop/files/4800086045928_a3e44532-775d-4c1e-bedb-e14d0e91475b_700x700.jpg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Nivea For Men Cool Kick Deodorant Roll On 25ml', NULL, 'Offers white mark protection on black clothes and anti-yellow staining on white clothes. Provides reliable 48-hour protection from sweat and odor. It is also anti-bacterial, leaving your skin feeling clean and fresh. Gentle on the skin with its skin tolerance dermatologically proven. Prevents deodorant stains on skin and clothes. Do not apply on irritated or damaged skin. Use daily for best results.', 66.48, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/232611749.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Unipak Mackerel In Natural Oil 155gm', '4800154013057', 'No description found.', 68.61, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/329682264.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Century Tuna Flakes Hot And Spicy 155g', '0748485100418', 'The classic all-time favorite, the original healthy meat rich in Omega3 DHA. A delicious indulgence with just the right level of spiciness. Enjoy it with pasta, salads, bread, and sandwiches. Contains 1 can (155 grams) of Century Tuna Flakes Hot And Spicy.', 96.35, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/94705654.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Rhea 70% Isopropyl Alcohol With Moisturizer 500ml', '4800067450871', 'This hand sanitizer Rhea Alcohol is contains 70% alcohol. Generally effective at killing a wide range of microorganisms, including many types of viruses. Helps remove dirt and grime from surfaces. Get this 1 bottle (500ml) of Rhea 70% Alcohol Compound.', 4.09, 11, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68258591.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Century Tuna Flakes Hot And Spicy 95g', '0748485102252', 'The classic all-time favorite, the original healthy meat rich in Omega3 DHA. A delicious indulgence with just the right level of spiciness. Enjoy it with pasta, salads, bread, and sandwiches. Contains 1 can (95 grams) of Century Tuna Flakes Hot And Spicy.', 1.65, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/87194653.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fresca Tuna Flakes Hot And Spicy 175g', '0748485900087', 'Savor the delectable taste of your favorite dish while enjoying the health benefits of fish. This product offers delicious goodness that you and your family will surely love. It is perfectly eaten with steamed rice, pasta, or bread. Contains 1 (175 grams) can of Fresca Tuna Flakes Hot And Spicy.', 85.59, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/205307763.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Vitamilk Double Choco Shake Soymilk Drink 300ML', '8851028002505', 'A tasty beverage for both kids and adults. It\'s rich in flavor and can be drunk at any time of the day. Made from soybeans and water and is an excellent substitute for cow\'s milk because of the equally high content of protein and fat. This highly nutritious soy milk is completely vegetable-based and natural and is especially ideal for vegans and people with lactose intolerance. Get this 1 pc (300ml) of Vitamilk Soya Milk Double Choco Shake.', 2.35, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352597899.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Pond\'s White Beauty Instabright Tone Up Milk Cream 6g', '4800888209672', 'A skin brightening product that gives you instantly bright skin upon use. It is enriched with Milk Essence, Vitamin B3, and Instabright Technology that allows for an immediate brightening effect, but also progressively evens out your skin tone. Get this 1 sachet (6 grams) of Pond\'s Pure White Facial Foam Ponds Cream White Beauty Tone-Up.', 65.33, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/53233873.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Argentina Corned Beef', '0748485801803', 'Argentina Corned Beef is deliciously flavorful, has meaty strands, is packed with protein. Made with 100% pure beef and fortified with zinc and iron to help boost immunity. Fully cooked, ready-to-eat corned beef. Get this 1 can (100 grams) of Argentina Corned Beef.', 11.03, 25, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68356939.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lotte Pepero Almond & Chocolate 8 Pcs X 32g', '8801062279579', 'Sure to make the Lotte Almond Pepero Chocolate your all time favourite. It contains wheat, milk, egg, soybean, almond, and peanut. That gives not only the proper nutritional value but also satisfies your taste buds.', 12.66, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/148559150.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lucky 7 Carne Norte', '0748485801469', 'Lucky 7 Carne Norte is deliciously sauteed, tasty, aromatic, and the most affordable Carne Norte on the market. Good taste, good quality, and excellent value are all packed in a brand meant to provide delectable and affordable meals to budget-conscious families. Convenient-fully cooked and ready to eat hot or cold. Get this 1 can (100 grams) of Lucky 7 Carne Norte.', 32.28, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68374496.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lidl Tube Qui Piquent', '4056489040163', 'No description found.', 90.29, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/206014269.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Lucky 7 Carne Norte EOC 210g', '0748485803951', 'Lucky 7 Carne Norte is deliciously sauteed, tasty, aromatic, and the most affordable Carne Norte on the market. Good taste, good quality, and excellent value are all packed in a brand meant to provide delectable and affordable meals to budget-conscious families. Convenient-fully cooked and ready to eat hot or cold. Get this 1 can (210 grams) of Lucky 7 Carne Norte.', 16.05, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68380572.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
