(2, 1, 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti 100ml', '4800344004964', 'Silver Swan Sukang Puti promises to make dishes even more delectable with its mild acidity. A delicious ingredient to add to marinades for your favorite meat dishes. Used to attain the right amount of sourness in the meals you prepare. Perfect for use in food preparation, and as an ingredient in popular sauces.', 28.92, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68202337.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Fin Carré Crusti Choc - 100g', NULL, 'No description found.', 91.00, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/142956474.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Off Family Care Insect Repellent Lotion 6ml', '4801234135010', 'An effective mosquito protection lotion that makes your family more protected. Provides continuous protection against Dengue-carrying mosquitoes. Comes in a Tropical Fresh fragrance that your whole family will surely love. It feels pleasant on the skin, it does not itch, and it is not sticky. Dermatologically tested suitable for children. Sold per sachet contains 6ml of Off Family Care Lotion.', 59.64, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68421537.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Super Crunch Corn Chips Sweet Corn 7g X 12\'s', '4800365101017', 'Enjoy this super-crunchy and thick corn chip loaded with gourmet sweet corn flavor. Packed with crunchy and wholesome corn chip snacks. Convenient on-the-go snacks are great for a busy lifestyle, at work, kids\' lunch snacks, and much more. Contains 12 pcs (7 grams each) of Super Crunch Corn Chips Sweet Corn.', 5.27, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68220541.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mediplast Gauze Pads 2x2', '4800067560884', 'No description found.', 54.31, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/121684021.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Coco Mama Fresh Gata 200ml', '0748485150079', 'Bring rich flavor to your dishes with Coco Mama. Made from squeezed coconuts for authentic gata goodness. Perfect for curries, stews, and Filipino specialties. Delivers creamy texture and natural coconut taste. Convenient and ready to use anytime. Get this 1 pack (200ml) of Coco Mama Fresh Gata.', 75.42, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68218338.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Funkids Potitos Chips Cheese 60g', '4806510786504', 'The crunchiness of this potato chip snack is perfectly created to win over your craving for a good potato chip snack. Made from the finest potato ingredients and distinctly thin, bringing out the fullness of its cheese flavor. These much-loved treats are fun to enjoy at lunch, as an after-school snack, or party refreshment. Get this 1 pack containing 60 grams of Funkids Potitos Chips Cheese.', 35.22, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68223124.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Mik Mik Choco Powder 20x5g', '4809010524119', 'No description found.', 81.37, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243939544.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Ajinomoto Umami Seasoning 50g', '4801958146002', 'Ajinomoto is a seasoning that enhances the Umami taste of all your dishes. Brings out the savory deliciousness of any kind of dish through the taste of umami. Pure monosodium glutamate made from crops like sugarcane, cassava, tapioca. Widely used to intensify and enhance umami flavors in sauces, broths, soups, and many more foods.', 20.10, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68305795.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Papa Banana Ketchup Sweet-Sarap 200g', '0014285003830', 'Kids love the sweet taste of Papa Banana Ketchup. It is the secret weapon used by moms to make kids eat heartily. This can be paired with kids’ well-loved dishes like hotdog, fried chicken and eggs. Best use for spaghetti sauce, fried foods dip sauce, burgers, and many more.', 40.59, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/230096738.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Benvoleo Alfaparf Milano Recovery Intense Regenerating Mask For Damaged Hair 250 Ml', '8022297144818', 'Alfaparf Milano Benvoleo Recovery Mask — восстанавливающая маска для поврежденных волос. Ее ценные питательные компоненты проникают глубоко и укрепляют волосы изнутри, устраняя ломкость. Это эффективное, легкое и приятное в использовании средство. Формула содержит гиперферментированный виноградный сок и гиперферментированную кору дуба с уникальными защитными и восстанавливающими свойствами. Маска защищает не только структуру, но и цвет, наполняет жизненной силой и возвращает здоровый блеск. Волосы становятся упругими, шелковистыми и послушными.', 81.26, 11, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/307341779.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tentay Premium Quality Patis Flavor Fish Sauce Refill 150mL', '4806030204755', 'Add a burst of umami flavor to your dishes with Tentay Patis. Made from fish extracts and seasonings. Provides a deep, savory taste. Perfect for seasoning, dipping sauces, or adding a unique touch to stir-fries and salads. Get this 1 pouch (150ml) of Tentay Patis Flavor SUP.', 69.65, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243183205.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'W.l. Tattoos Corn Chips Pizza 58g', '4806521798268', 'Indulge in a tasty snack with W.L. Tattoos Corn Chips Pizza. Crispy corn chips that deliver a satisfying crunch in every bite. Perfectly seasoned with a delicious pizza flavor that satisfies your snack cravings. Convenient 58-gram pack, ideal for snacking on the go or sharing with friends.', 83.01, 39, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243036040.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Del Monte Spaghetti Sauce Filipino Style 250g', '4800024575487', 'Experience the rich and bold flavors of this spaghetti sauce in the Filipino style of Del Monte. Made with sun-ripened tomatoes, aromatic herbs, and a special blend of spices, this sauce captures the essence of Filipino cuisine. It\'s the perfect balance of sweet and savory, giving your pasta dishes an unmistakable Filipino touch. Get this 1 pack (250 grams) of Del Monte Spaghetti Sauce Filipino Style.', 41.27, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68256997.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Young\'s Town Sardines In Tomato Sauce With Hot Chili 155g', '4800527123055', 'Taste the bold and delicious flavor of Young\'s Town Sardines. Made in water, tomato sauce, fish oil, iodized salt, chili, and other spices. Perfect pair with steamed rice, pasta, or bread. Perfect for quick and easy meals on the go. Get this 1 can (155 grams) of Young\'s Town Sardines Chili Sauce Easy Open.', 28.14, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/129386994.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Pond\'s Pure Bright Facial Foam 10g', '4800888154941', 'Formulated with activated carbon and vitamin B3. It removes dead skin cells and impurities in your skin from the inside, resulting in brighter, radiant skin on the outside. It has activated carbon that is known to act like a magnet to suck out pollution, dirt and dust, to help you uncover your natural glow. Get this 1 sachet (10grams) of Pond\'s Pure White Facial Foam.', 54.24, 43, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68240355.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Charmee Panty Liner Breathable Unscented 20pcs X24', '4800488100065', 'The soft and comfortable cotton cover provides smooth and gentle protection to the skin. Top sheet cover which allows air to pass thru providing a clean and fresh feeling. Breathable back sheet. Allows circulation of air giving your skin a long-lasting fresh feeling. Sold per pack containing 20 pieces of Charmee Breathable Pantyliners Unscented.', 68.34, 41, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68452132.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Royal Sweet Corn 8g X 20\'s', '4801188102021', 'These crunchy, munchy sweet corn balls are finger-licking fun you won\'t want to put down. Put it in a bowl and you’ll have a snack that everyone can agree on. Perfect for hanging out with friends or enjoying yourself on your own. Containing 20 packs in 1 bag.', 1.20, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68221338.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Great Taste Premium Blend 25gx48', '4800016012266', 'An instant coffee that offers a rich taste and aroma that you’ll surely love. The strong, rejuvenating taste and rich aroma of Great Taste Granules helps lighten mental alertness and provide an added push. Captures the goodness of perfectly roasted 100% Robusta coffee beans. Sold per piece contains 25 grams of Great Taste Premium Instant Coffee.', 98.72, 5, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68249576.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Keratin Plus Luxurious Brazilian Hair Treatment Red 20g', '4806515161580', 'Discover the luscious transformation of your hair with Keratin Plus Luxurious, the premier Brazilian Hair Treatment crafted to give your locks a rejuvenating boost. This carefully formulated solution harnesses the power of keratin proteins to deeply nourish and restore vitality to every strand. Suitable for all hair types, Keratin Plus Luxurious dramatically smooths, softens, and adds a radiant shine that truly captures the spirit of Brazil’s iconic hair beauty secrets. Embrace the ease of styling with reduced frizz and long-lasting results. Get ready to flaunt silky, manageable hair that feels just as good as it looks.', 55.91, 23, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/144418360.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tang Powdered Juice Fruit And Veg Dalandan + Malunggay 19g', '7622300991975', 'Can provide essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. With a high source of vitamin C equivalent to 1 Dalandan and a high source of Iron equivalent to 1 cup of Malunggay. Perfect for every snack and gathering. Each sachet makes 1 liter of juice. Sold per piece contains 19 grams of Tang Powdered Juice Fruit and Veg Dalandan + Malunggay.', 64.85, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68438743.jpeg', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tang Grape Juice Sachet', '7622300637996', 'Jumpstart your morning with a refreshing glass of Tang. An instant grapes powder drink that helps you prepare refreshing, delicious drinks within a few minutes. Contains 100% daily value vitamin C per serving and is a good source of calcium to help start your day. Tasty and refreshing tang powder juice is the perfect addition to any meal. Try this 1 pack containing 19 grams of Tang Powdered Juice Grapes.', 19.96, 25, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352598536.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16'),
(2, 1, 'Tang Mango Powder 20g', '7622300601782', 'Then you\'ll love TANG Mango! This delicious instant drink mix is made with real fruit extract and no artificial flavors. It\'s easy to mix and drink, and it\'s a great way to hydrate your body. Plus, it\'s packed with 100% vitamin C.', 86.63, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352619559.png', 1, '2026-03-21 05:16:16', '2026-03-21 05:16:16');
